ed. QUIC.cloud deactivated automatically. Please reactivate your QUIC.cloud account.'=>'Goobta lama aqoonsado. QUIC.cloud si otomaatig ah ayaa loo damiyay. Fadlan dib u howlgeli koontadaada QUIC.cloud.','Click here to proceed.'=>'Guji halkan si aad u sii waddo.','QUIC.cloud\'s access to your WP REST API seems to be blocked.'=>'Waxaa u muuqata in helitaanka QUIC.cloud ee WP REST API-gaaga la xiray.','Failed to get echo data from WPAPI'=>'Waa la waayay in laga soo saaro xogta echo WPAPI','You need to set the %1$s first. Please use the command %2$s to set.'=>'Waa inaad marka hore dejiso %1$s. Fadlan isticmaal amarka %2$s si aad u dejiso.','Server IP'=>'Server IP','You need to activate QC first.'=>'Waa inaad marka hore howlgelisaa QC.','Cert or key file does not exist.'=>'Feylka shahaadada ama furaha ma jiro.','Reset %s activation successfully.'=>'Waxaa si guul leh dib loogu meelayay shaqaysiinta %s.','Linked to QUIC.cloud preview environment, for testing purpose only.'=>'Waxaa lagu xiray deegaanka horudhaca ee QUIC.cloud, ujeedooyin tijaabo ah oo keliya.','Cloud Error'=>'Cilladda Daruuraha','No available Cloud Node after checked server load.'=>'Ma jiro Cloud Node la heli karo ka dib markii la eegay culayska server-ka.','No available Cloud Node.'=>'Ma jiro Cloud Node la heli karo.','In order to use QC services, need a real domain name, cannot use an IP.'=>'Si loo isticmaalo adeegyada QC, waxaad u baahan tahay magaca domain-ka dhabta ah, mana isticmaali kartid IP.','Please try after %1$s for service %2$s.'=>'Fadlan isku day %1$s kadib adeegga %2$s.','Failed to request via WordPress'=>'Waa lagu guuldarraystay in la codsado iyada oo loo marayo WordPress','Cloud server refused the current request due to unpulled images. Please pull the images first.'=>'Server-ka daruurtu wuu diiday codsiga hadda jira sababtoo ah sawirrada lama soo jiidin. Fadlan marka hore soo jiid sawirrada.','Your domain_key has been temporarily blocklisted to prevent abuse. You may contact support at QUIC.cloud to learn more.'=>'Domain_key-gaaga ayaa si ku-meel-gaar ah looga mamnuucay liiska si looga hortago xadgudubka. Waxaad kala xiriiri kartaa taageerada QUIC.cloud si aad wax badan uga ogaato.','Cloud server refused the current request due to rate limiting. Please try again later.'=>'Serbarka daruuraha ayaa diiday codsiga hadda jira sababtoo ah xaddidaadda heerka. Fadlan isku day mar dambe.','Redetected node'=>'Node-ka dib loo ogaaday','We are working hard to improve your online service experience. The service will be unavailable while we work. We apologize for any inconvenience.'=>'Waxaan si adag ugu shaqeyneynaa inaan hagaajino khibradaada adeegga internetka. Adeegga lama heli doono inta aan shaqeyneyno. Waan ka cudurdaaranaa wixii dhib ah ee yimaada.','Message from QUIC.cloud server'=>'Farriinta ka timid adeegaha QUIC.cloud','Good news from QUIC.cloud server'=>'War wanaagsan oo ka yimid server-ka QUIC.cloud','%1$s plugin version %2$s required for this action.'=>'%1$s nuuca plugin %2$s waa looga baahan yahay ficilkan.','Failed to communicate with QUIC.cloud server'=>'Waa la waayay isgaarsiinta server-ka QUIC.cloud','Sync QUIC.cloud status successfully.'=>'Xaaladda QUIC.cloud ayaa si guul leh loo waafajiyay.','Sync credit allowance with Cloud Server successfully.'=>'Si guul leh ayaad deymaha la oggol yahay ugu waafajisay Cloud Server.','Saving option failed. IPv4 only for %s.'=>'Keydsiga ikhtiyaarka waa fashilmay. IPv4 oo keliya loogu talagalay %s.','Changed setting successfully.'=>'Dejinta waa la badalay.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge everything.'=>'Waxaa la ogeysiiyay LiteSpeed Web Server in la tirtiro wax walba.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge the list.'=>'Waxaa la ogeysiiyey LiteSpeed Web Server in uu tirtiro liiska.','Sitemap cleaned successfully'=>'Khariidadda bogga si guul leh ayaa loo nadiifiyay','No valid sitemap parsed for crawler.'=>'Ma jiro sitemap sax ah oo loo dhexgalay cdarroolaha (crawler).','Sitemap created successfully: %d items'=>'Khariidadda bogga waa la sameeyay: %d shay','Crawler disabled list is cleared! All crawlers are set to active! '=>'Liiska cawskadaha la xiray waa la tirtiray! Dhamaan cawskadaha waxaa loo meel myay inay shaqaynayaan!','Started async crawling'=>'Gurguurashada asynchronous-ka ah waa la bilaabay','Guest'=>'Marti','Manually added to blocklist'=>'Si gacmo ah ayaa loogu daray liiska madow','Previously existed in blocklist'=>'Horay ugu jiray liiska madow','The database has been upgrading in the background since %s. This message will disappear once upgrade is complete.'=>'Kaydka xogta ayaa dib loo cusboonaysiinayay asalka ilaa %s. Fikirkani wuu baaba\'i doonaa marka cusboonaysiinta la dhammeeyo.','Clean all successfully.'=>'Dhammaan si guul leh u nadiifi.','Clean post revisions successfully.'=>'Dib-u-eegisyada qoraalka si guul leh ayaa loo nadiifiyay.','Clean orphaned post meta successfully.'=>'Si guul leh ayay u nadiifisay meta-da qoraalka ee dayacan.','Clean auto drafts successfully.'=>'Draft-yada otomaatiga ah ayaa si guul leh loo nadiifiyay.','Clean trashed posts and pages successfully.'=>'Si guul leh u nadiifi qoraallada iyo bogagga la qashin-qubka saaray.','Clean spam comments successfully.'=>'Faaruqi faallada spam-ka ah si guul leh.','Clean trashed comments successfully.'=>'Faallada qashinka lagu daray waxaa la nadiifiyay si guul leh.','Clean trackbacks and pingbacks successfully.'=>'Si guul leh u nadiifi trackbacks iyo pingbacks.','Clean expired transients successfully.'=>'Si guul leh ayaa loo nadiifiyay xog-ku-meel-gaarka ah ee dhacay.','Clean all transients successfully.'=>'Dhammaan xogaha ku meel-gaarka ah waa la nadiifiyay si guul leh.','Optimized all tables.'=>'Dhammaan miisaska waa la wanaajiyay.','Converted to InnoDB successfully.'=>'Si guul leh loogu beddelay InnoDB.','Invalid log type.'=>'Nooca diiwaanka waa mid aan shaqaynayn.','Log file not found.'=>'Fayisha diiwaanka lama helin.','This setting is %1$s for certain qualifying requests due to %2$s!'=>'Dejintaani waa %1$s codsiyada qaarkood ee u qalma sabab la xiriirta %2$s!','This setting will regenerate crawler list and clear the disabled list!'=>'Habkani waxa uu dib u soo saari doonaa liiska ciraaqiyaha oo uu tirtiri doonaa liiska naafada ah!','This site utilizes caching in order to facilitate a faster response time and better user experience. Caching potentially stores a duplicate copy of every web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily.'=>'Boggan wuxuu adeegsadaa keydka ku meel-gaarka ah (caching) si loo fududeeyo jawaab degdeg ah iyo waayo-aragnimo isticmaale oo wanaagsan. Keydka ku meel-gaarka ah wuxuu suurtogal ka dhigayaa inuu kaydiyo koobbi labaad oo bog kasta oo shabakad ah oo ka muuqda boggan. Dhammaan faylasha keydka waa kuwo ku meel-gaar ah, mana heli karo cid saddexaad, marka laga reebo sida lagama maarmaanka u ah helitaanka taageerada farsamo ee iibiyaha furaha keydka (cache plugin). Faylasha keydka waxay dhacaan jadwalka uu dejiyay maamulaha bogga, laakiin waxaa si fudud u tirtiri kara maamulaha ka hor intaanay dhicin waqtigooda dabiiciga ah, haddii loo baahdo. Waxaan isticmaali karnaa adeegyada QUIC.cloud si aan u baahino oo u keydino xogtaada si ku meel gaar ah.','Learn More'=>'Wax Dheeraad ah Baro','Both full and partial strings can be used.'=>'Labada xadhig ee buuxa iyo kuwa qaybta ahba waa la isticmaali karaa.','Both full URLs and partial strings can be used.'=>'Labada URL oo buuxa iyo xadhkaha qaybta ahba waa la isticmaali karaa.','This setting will edit the .htaccess file.'=>'Dejintani waxay wax ka beddeli doontaa faylka .htaccess.','The queue is processed asynchronously. It may take time.'=>'Safafka waxaa loo habeeyaa si aan isla-markaas ahayn. Waxay qaadan kartaa waqti.','This feature needs an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin. The setting has no effect.'=>'Tilmaan-bixintani waxay u baahan tahay adeeg jiilka khadka ah, oo aan ku jirin furahan. Dejintani wax saameyn ah ma leh.','You have used all of your daily quota for today.'=>'Waxaad isticmaashay dhammaan saamigaaga maalinlaha ah ee maanta.','Learn more or purchase additional quota.'=>'Wax badan baro ama iibso kooto dheeraad ah.','You have used all of your quota left for current service this month.'=>'Waxaad isticmaashay dhammaan saamigii aad u lahayd adeegga hadda jira bishan.','You have too many requested images, please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Waxaad codsatay sawirro aad u badan, fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo gudahood.','You have images waiting to be pulled. Please wait for the automatic pull to complete, or pull them down manually now.'=>'Waxaad haysataa sawirро sugaya in la soo jiido. Fadlan sug inta ay soo jiidista tooska ahi dhammaanayso, ama hadda gacanta ku soo jiid.','The image list is empty.'=>'Liiska sawirradu waa madhan yahay.','Not enough parameters. Please check if the QUIC.cloud connection is set correctly'=>'Parameters kuma filna. Fadlan hubi in xiriirka QUIC.cloud si sax ah loo habeeyay','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet.'=>'Waxaa jira saf socda oo aan weli la soo jiidin.','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet. Queue info: %s.'=>'Waxaa jira saf socda oo aan la jiidin weli. Macluumaadka safka: %s.','The site is not a valid alias on QUIC.cloud.'=>'Boggu ma aha magac-u-rogad (alias) sax ah oo ku yaalla QUIC.cloud.','The site is not registered on QUIC.cloud.'=>'Goobtu laguma diiwaangelin QUIC.cloud.','The QUIC.cloud connection is not correct. Please try to sync your QUIC.cloud connection again.'=>'Xiriirka QUIC.cloud sax ma ahan. Fadlan isku day inaad mar labaad waafajiso xiriirkaaga QUIC.cloud.','The current server is under heavy load.'=>'Server-ka hadda wuxuu ku jiraa culeys culus.','Online node needs to be redetected.'=>'Node-ka khadka waa in dib loo ogaadaa.','Credits are not enough to proceed the current request.'=>'Dhibcuhu kuma filna in lagu sii wado codsiga hadda.','%s file not writable.'=>'%s faylku lama qori karo.','Could not find %1$s in %2$s.'=>'Lama helin %1$s dhexda %2$s.','Invalid login cookie. Please check the %s file.'=>'Kookie-ga gelitaanka waa mid aan ansax ahayn. Fadlan hubi faylka %s.','Failed to back up %s file, aborted changes.'=>'Waa la waayay in la kaydiyo faylka %s, isbeddelladii waa la joojiyay.','%s file not readable.'=>'%s faylku lama akhriyi karo.','Failed to get %s file contents.'=>'Waa la waayay in la helo waxyaabaha ku jira faylka %s.','Failed to create table %1$s! SQL: %2$s.'=>'Waa la waayay in la abuuro miiska %1$s! SQL: %2$s.','Crawler disabled by the server admin.'=>'Isku-duobaha (Crawler) waxaa hawl-gabiyay maamulaha adeegeha.','Previous request too recent. Please try again later.'=>'Codsigii hore aad buu u dhawaa. Fadlan dib u tijaabi hadhow.','Previous request too recent. Please try again after %s.'=>'Codsigii hore aad buu dhowaa. Fadlan dib u day ka dib %s.','Your application is waiting for approval.'=>'Codsigaagu wuxuu sugayaa in la ansixiyo.','The callback validation to your domain failed due to hash mismatch.'=>'Xaqiijinta soo celinta ee domain-kaaga waa ay guuldareysatay sababtoo ah hash-ka oo aan is-lahayn.','The callback validation to your domain failed. Please make sure there is no firewall blocking our servers.'=>'Xaqiijinta dib u yeeritaanka ee domain-kaaga waa ay fashilantay. Fadlan hubi in uusan jirin gidaar dab (firewall) xiraya server-adayada.','The callback validation to your domain failed. Please make sure there is no firewall blocking our servers. Response code: '=>'Xaqiijinta dib u yeerista ee domain-kaaga waa la weeciyay. Fadlan hubi in uusan jirin dab-demis (firewall) xiraya server-adaha. Koodka jawaabta:','You