faylasha Gravatar waa la nadiifiyay.','Cleaned all localized resource entries.'=>'Waa la nadiifiyey dhammaan qoraallada agabka maxalliga ah.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge CSS/JS entries.'=>'Waxaa LiteSpeed Web Server lagu ogeysiiyay in la tirtiro gelitaannada CSS/JS.','OPcache is not enabled.'=>'OPcache lama shaqaysiin.','OPcache is restricted by %s setting.'=>'OPcache waxaa xaddidaya %s goobta.','Reset the OPcache failed.'=>'Dib u dejinta OPcache wuu guuldarraystay.','Reset the entire OPcache successfully.'=>'OPcache oo dhan ayaa si guul leh loo habeeyay.','Object cache is not enabled.'=>'Kaydka shayga waa mid aan la shaqaysiin.','Purge all object caches successfully.'=>'Dhammaan kaydinta walxaha waa la tirtiray si guul leh.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge the front page.'=>'Waxaa la ogeysiiyay LiteSpeed Web Server si uu u nadiifiyo bogga hore.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge all pages.'=>'Waxaa la ogeysiiyay LiteSpeed Web Server inuu tirtiro dhammaan boggagta.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge error pages.'=>'Wuxuu ogeysiiyay LiteSpeed Web Server inuu tirtiro bogagga khaladaadka.','Purge category %s'=>'Nadiifi qaybta %s','Purge tag %s'=>'Tirtir sumaddu %s','Purge url %s'=>'Nadiifi url %s','All QUIC.cloud service queues have been cleared.'=>'Dhammaan safafka adeegga QUIC.cloud waa la nadiifiyay.','Every 15 Minutes'=>'15-kii daqiiqaba','LiteSpeed Crawler Cron'=>'LiteSpeed Crawler Cron','Failed to detect IP'=>'Waa lagu guuldarraystay in la ogaado IP-ga','right now'=>'hadda','just now'=>'hada hada',' %s ago'=>'%s kahor','Please consider disabling the following detected plugins, as they may conflict with Zinn® Cache Engine:'=>'Fadlan tixgeli inaad damiso qalab-gelisyada la ogaaday ee soo socda, maadaama ay khilaaf kala kulmi karaan Zinn® Cache Engine:','WooCommerce Settings'=>'Dejinta WooCommerce','NOTICE:'=>'OGEYSIIS:','After verifying that the cache works in general, please test the cart.'=>'Ka dib markii aad xaqiijisay in keydku uu si guud u shaqeynayo, fadlan tijaabi gaariga.','To test the cart, visit the %sFAQ%s.'=>'Si aad u tijaabiso gaadhiga, booqo %sFAQ%s.','By default, the My Account, Checkout, and Cart pages are automatically excluded from caching. Misconfiguration of page associations in WooCommerce settings may cause some pages to be erroneously excluded.'=>'Sida caadiga ah, bogagga My Account, Checkout, and Cart ayaa si otomaatig ah looga reebayaa keydinta (caching). Qorsheyn xumida xiriirinta bogagga ee dejinta WooCommerce ayaa sababi karta in bogag qaar si khaldan looga reebo.','Product Update Interval'=>'Waqtiga La cusboonaysiiyo Badeecada','Purge product on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Nadiifi badeecada marka ay yimaadaan isbeddellada tirada ama xaaladda kaydka.','Purge categories only when stock status changes.'=>'Nadiifi qaybaha kaliya marka xaaladda kaydka ay isbeddesho.','Purge product and categories only when the stock status changes.'=>'Nadiifi alaabta iyo qaybaha kaliya marka heerka badeecaddu isbeddesho.','Purge product only when the stock status changes.'=>'Nadiifi badeecada kaliya marka uu xaaladda kaydku isbeddelo.','Do not purge categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Ha tirtirin qaybaha marka la beddelo tirada ama xaaladda badeecadda ee keydka.','Always purge both product and categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Had iyo jeer nadiifi badeecada iyo qaybaha labadaba marka ay yimaadaan isbeddellada tirada ama heerka kaydka.','Determines how changes in product quantity and product stock status affect product pages and their associated category pages.'=>'Waxay go\'aamisaa sida ay isbeddellada tirada badeecadda iyo xaaladda saamiga badeecaddu u saameeyaan bogagga badeecadda iyo bogagga qaybaha la xiriira.','Vary for Mini Cart'=>'U beddel gaariga yar','Generate a separate vary cache copy for the mini cart when the cart is not empty.'=>'Abuur nuqul keydso oo kala duwan oo loogu talagalay gaariga yar marka gaarigu uusan madhnayn.','If your theme does not use JS to update the mini cart, you must enable this option to display the correct cart contents.'=>'Haddii mawduucagu uusan isticmaalin JS si uu u cusboonaysiiyo gaadhiga yar, waa inaad shaqadan kartaa si aad u soo bandhigto waxyaabaha saxda ah ee gaadhiga.','New Developer Version Available!'=>'Nooca cusub ee horumarinta waa la heli karaa!','New developer version %s is available now.'=>'Nooca cusub ee horumariyaha %s ayaa hadda la heli karaa.','Upgrade'=>'Cusbooneysii','Purge'=>'Nadiifi','Excludes'=>'Ka reebeysa','Object'=>'Sheyga','Browser'=>'Birawshar','Advanced'=>'Sareeye','Zinn® Cache Engine Network Cache Settings'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Habaynta Kaydka Ku-meel-gaarka ah ee Shabakadda','TTL'=>'TTL','ESI'=>'ESI','Zinn® Cache Engine Settings'=>'Dejinta Mashiinka Kaydka ee Zinn®','NOTE'=>'FIIRO GAAR AH','More settings available under %s menu'=>'Dejinta badan ayaa laga heli karaa liiska %s','Advanced Settings'=>'Dejinta Sare','Cache Control Settings'=>'Dejinta Xakamaynta Kaydka Ku Meel Gaarka ah','Network Enable Cache'=>'Shabakadda Kordhiso Kaydka (Cache)','Enabling Zinn® Cache Engine for WordPress here enables the cache for the network.'=>'Halkan oo la awoodsiiyo Zinn® Cache Engine ee WordPress waxay awood u siineysaa kaydinta shabakadda.','It is STRONGLY recommended that the compatibility with other plugins on a single/few sites is tested first.'=>'Waxaa si adag lagugula talinayaa in marka hore la tijaabiyo la-qabsashada ee plugins-yada kale ee ku jira hal ama dhawr mareegood.','This is to ensure compatibility prior to enabling the cache for all sites.'=>'Tani waa si loo xaqiijiyo waafaqidda ka hor inta aan la suurtagelin kaydka (cache) ee dhammaan goobaha.','Exclude Settings'=>'Ka reeb dejinta','Purge Settings'=>'Dejinta Nadiifinta','These settings are meant for ADVANCED USERS ONLY.'=>'Dejintaani waxaa loogu talagalay ISTICMAALAYAASHA HORUMARSAN KELIYA.','Specify an AJAX action in POST/GET and the number of seconds to cache that request, separated by a space.'=>'Sheeg ficilka AJAX ee POST/GET iyo tirada ilbiriqsi ee lagu kaydinayo codasigaas, oo ay kala soocaan meel bannaan.','Enable this option if you are using both HTTP and HTTPS in the same domain and are noticing cache irregularities.'=>'Kici ikhtiyaarkan haddii aad isticmaalayso labada HTTP iyo HTTPS isku degel oo aad dareemayso cillado dhinaca kaydka (cache) ah.','When a visitor hovers over a page link, preload that page. This will speed up the visit to that link.'=>'Markuu booqdaygu dul heehaabo xiriiriyaha bogga, horay u soo rar boggaas. Tani waxay dedejin doontaa booqashada xiriiriyahaas.','This will generate extra requests to the server, which will increase server load.'=>'Tani waxay abuuri doontaa codsiyo dheeraad ah oo ku socda adeegaha, taas oo kordhin doonta culayska adeegaha.','Use Network Admin Setting'=>'Isticmaal Dejinta Maamulka Shabakadda','Please visit the %sInformation%s page on how to test the cache.'=>'Fadlan booqo bogga %sMacluumaadka%s si aad u ogaato sida loo tijaabiyo kaydka (cache).','NOTICE'=>'OGEYSIIS','When disabling the cache, all cached entries for this site will be purged.'=>'Marka la daminayo kaydka (cache), dhammaan gelitaannada kaydsan ee bishan waa la tirtiri doonaa.','The network admin setting can be overridden here.'=>'Dejinta maamulaha shabakadda waa la tirtiri karaa ama la bedeli karaa halkan.','Privately cache frontend pages for logged-in users. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Si gaar ah u kaydi boggagta hore ee isticmaaleyaasha soo galay. (LSWS %s ayaa loo baahan yahay)','Privately cache commenters that have pending comments. Disabling this option will serve non-cacheable pages to commenters. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Kaydi dadka faallooyinka ka tago ee leh faallooyinka sugaya si qarsoodi ah. Damiin ikhtiyaarkan waxay macaamiisha faallooyinka u adeegaysaa boggag aan la kaydin karin. (Waxaa loo baahan yahay LSWS %s)','Cache requests made by WordPress REST API calls.'=>'Kaydi codsiyada ay sameeyeen wicitaannada WordPress REST API.','Disabling this option may negatively affect performance.'=>'Naafaynta ikhtiyaarkan waxay si xun u saameyn kartaa waxqabadka.','URI Paths containing these strings will NOT be cached as public.'=>'Waddooyinka URI ee ay ku jiraan xargahan LAMA keydin doono sidoo kale dadweynaha.','Paths containing these strings will be cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Waddooyinka ka kooban xargahan waxaa loo kaydin doonaa si ku-meelgaar ah iyada oo aan loo eegin goobaha aan la kaydinin.','To define a custom TTL for a URI, add a space followed by the TTL value to the end of the URI.'=>'Si aad u qeexdo TTL caadi ah oo loogu talagalay URI, ku dar meel bannaan oo ay ku xigto qiimaha TTL dhammaadka URI.','For example, %1$s defines a TTL of %2$s seconds for %3$s.'=>'Tusaale ahaan, %1$s waxay qeexaysaa TTL ah %2$s ilbiriqsi oo loogu talagalay %3$s.','Paths containing these strings will be forced to public cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Waddooyinka ka kooban xadhkahan waxaa lagu qasbi doonaa inay noqdaan kuwo guud ahaan la keydiyay iyada oo aan loo eegin habaynta aan la kaydin karin.','ESI Settings'=>'Dejinta ESI','With ESI (Edge Side Includes), pages may be served from cache for logged-in users.'=>'Adoo adeegsanaya ESI (Edge Side Includes), boggag waxaa laga bixin karaa keydka (cache) isticmaaleyaasha soo galay.','ESI allows you to designate parts of your dynamic page as separate fragments that are then assembled together to make the whole page. In other words, ESI lets you “punch holes” in a page, and then fill those holes with content that may be cached privately, cached publicly with its own TTL, or not cached at all.'=>'ESI waxay kuugu reebaysaa inaad qaybo ka mid ah boggaaga meelaha beddelma u calaamadsato burburro gaar ah oo ka dib laysugu geeyo si ay u samaysataan bogga oo dhan. Si kale haddii loo dhigo, ESI waxay ku siinaysaa inaad "godad u qoddo" bogga, ka dibna aad godadkaas ku buuxiso content si gaar ah loo kaydin karo, ama si doorto ah lagu kaydin karo TTL ku xidhan, ama aan la kaydin karin gabi ahaanba.','WpW: Private Cache vs. Public Cache'=>'WpW: Kaydka Gaarka ah vs. Kaydka Dadweynaha','You can turn shortcodes into ESI blocks.'=>'Waxaad gaabiyaha ka dhigi kartaa baloogyada ESI.','Replace %1$s with %2$s.'=>'Beddel %1$s oo geli %2$s.','ESI sample for developers'=>'Tusaalaha ESI ee horumariyeyaasha','WARNING'=>'DIGINIIN','These options are only available with LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.'=>'Xulisyadani waxay kaliya ku jiraan LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.','Turn ON to cache public pages for logged in users, and serve the Admin Bar and Comment Form via ESI blocks. These two blocks will be uncached unless enabled below.'=>'Daari si aad u kaydiso bogagga dadweynaha ee isticmaaleyaasha soo galay, oo aad ugu adeegto Bar Maamuleedka iyo Foomka Faallooyinka adoo adeegsanaya baloogyada ESI. Labadan baloog lama kaydin doono ilaa laga shaqaysiiyo hoos.','Cache the built-in Admin Bar ESI block.'=>'Kaydso barta ku dhex-dhisan ee Admin Bar ESI.','Cache the built-in Comment Form ESI block.'=>'Kaydi qaybta ESI ee Foomka Faallooyinka ee dhex-dhisnaa.','The list will be merged with the predefined nonces in your local data file.'=>'Liistada waxaa lagu biirin doonaa waxyaabaha aan la cayimin ee hore loo qeexay ee ku jira faylkaaga xogta maxalliga ah.','The latest data file is'=>'Fayisha xogta ee ugu dambeysay waa','Filter %s is supported.'=>'Shaandhaynta %s waa la taageerayaa.','The above nonces will be converted to ESI automatically.'=>'Kor ku xusan nonces waxaa si toos ah loogu beddeli doonaa ESI.','An optional second parameter may be used to specify cache control. Use a space to separate'=>'Halbeeg labaad oo ikhtiyaari ah ayaa loo isticmaali karaa si loo cayimo kontoroolka kaydka (cache). Isticmaal meel bannaan (boos) si aad u kala soocdo','Wildcard %1$s supported (match zero or more characters). For example, to match %2$s and %3$s, use %4$s.'=>'Wildcard %1$s waa la taageerayaa (isku mid ah eber ama in ka badan xarfaha). Tusaale ahaan, si aad u waafajiso %2$s iyo %3$s, isticmaal %4$s.','If your site contains public content that certain user roles can see but other roles cannot, you can specify a Vary Group for those user roles. For example, specifying an administrator vary group allows there to be a separate publicly-cached page tailored to administrators (with “edit” links, etc), while all other user roles see the default public page.'=>'Haddii bartaadu ay leedahay waxyaabaha dadweynaha ee ay doorarka isticmaaleha qaarkood arki karaan laakiin kuwa kalena aysan arki karin, waxaad u qeexi kartaa Kooxda Kala-duwanaanshaha (Vary Group) doorarkaas isticmaaleha. Tusaale ahaan, qeexidda koox kala-duwanaansho maamule waxay u oggolaaneysaa in ay jirto bog si gaar ah loogu kaydiyey dadweynaha oo loogu talagalay maamulayaasha (oo wata xiriiriyeyaasha "wax ka beddelka", iwm.), halka dhammaan doorarka isticmaaleha kale ay arkaan bogga dadweynaha ee caadiga ah.','Paths containing these strings will not be cached.'=>'Wadada ay ku jiraan xarfahan lama kaydin doono.','Predefined list will also be combined w/ the above settings'=>'Liiska horay loo qeexay ayaa sidoo kale lagu dari doonaa habaynta kore','Query strings containing these parameters will not be cached.'=>'Weydiinta xadhkaha ee ay ku jiraan cabirradan lama kaydin doono.','For example, for %1$s, %2$s and %3$s can be used here.'=>'Tusaale ahaan, %1$s, %2$s iyo %3$s ayaa halkan looga isticmaali karaa.','All categories are cached by default.'=>'Dhammaan qaybaha waa la kaydiyaa si caadi ah.','To prevent %s from being cached, enter them here.'=>'Si looga hortago in %s la kaydiyo, halkan geli.','categories'=>'Qeybaha','If the category name is not found, the category will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Haddii magaca qaybta la waayo, qaybta waxaa laga saari doonaa liiska markaa la keydiyo.','All tags are cached by default.'=>'Dhammaan calaamadaha waxaa lagu kaydiyaa xusuusta kaydka (cache) si caad ah.','tags'=>'calaamadaha','If the tag slug is not found, the tag will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Haddii calaamadda slug aan la helin, calaamadda waxaa laga saari doonaa liiska markii la keydiyo.','To exclude %1$s, insert %2$s.'=>'Si aad uga reebto %1$s, geli %2$s.','Selected roles will be excluded from cache.'=>'Dooqyada la xulay lagama reebi doono keydka (cache).','All pages'=>'Dhammaan bogagga','Front page'=>'Bogga hore','Home page'=>'Bogga hoose','Pages'=>'Bogagga','All pages with Recent Posts Widget'=>'Dhammaan bogagga wata Agabka Qoraallada Cusub','Author archive'=>'Kaydka qoraaga','Post type archive'=>'Kaydka nooca qoraalka','Yearly archive'=>'Kaydka sanadlaha ah','Monthly archive'=>'Kaydka bilaha ah','Daily archive'=>'Kaydka maalinlaha ah','Term archive (include category, tag, and tax)'=>'Kaydka erayada (oo ay ku jiraan qaybta, sumadda, iyo canshuurta)','Auto Purge Rules For Publish/Update'=>'Xeerarka Nadiifinta Tooska ah ee Daabacaadda/Cusboonaysiinta','Note'=>'Xusuusin','Select "All" if there are dynamic widgets linked to posts on pages other than the front or home pages.'=>'Xoog Dooro "Dhamman" haddii ay jiraan wijityo cusboonaada oo ku xiran qoraallada ku jira bogagga kale oo ah kuwo aan ahayn bogga hore ama bogga hooyga.','Other checkboxes will be ignored.'=>'Sanduuqyada kale ee calaamadaynta waxaa la iska indhatiri doonaa.','Select only the archive types that are currently used, the others can be left unchecked.'=>'Dooro oo keliya noocyada kaydka ee hadda la isticmaalo, kuwa kalena waa laga tagi karaa iyaga oo aan la dooran.','Select which pages will be automatically purged when posts are published/updated.'=>'Dooro bogagga si otomaatig ah loo nadiifin doono marka la daabaco ama la cusboonaysiiyo qoraallada.','If ON, the stale copy of a cached page will be shown to visitors until a new cache copy is available. Reduces the server load for following visits. If OFF, the page will be dynamically generated while visitors wait.'=>'Haddii ay SHIDAN tahay, nuqulka dhacay ee bogga la kaydiyay ayaa loo muujin doonaa booqdayaasha ilaa nuqul cusub oo la kaydiyay uu ka diyaarsanayo. Wuxuu hoos u dhigaa culayska adeegaha ee booqashooyinka xiga. Haddii ay DAMSAN tahay, bogga si cusub ayaa loo soo saari doonaa inta ay booqdayaashu sugayaan.','By design, this option may serve stale content. Do not enable this option, if that is not OK with you.'=>'Naqshad ahaan, ikhtiyaarkan waxaa laga yaabaa inuu adeegsado waxyaabo duugowday. Ha suurtagelin ikhtiyaarkan, haddii aysan taasi dhibaato kugu ahayn.','The URLs here (one per line) will be purged automatically at the time set in the option "%s".'=>'URL-lada halkan ku yaal (midkiiba hal safar) ayaa si toos ah loo tirtiri doonaa wakhtiga lagu asteeyay xulashada "%s".','Both %1$s and %2$s are acceptable.'=>'Labada %1$s iyo %2$s waa la aqbali karaa.','For URLs with wildcards, there may be a delay in initiating scheduled purge.'=>'Url-yada wata calaamadda wildcards, waxaa laga yaabaa in dib u dhac uu ku yimaado bilaabidda nadiifinta la qorsheeyay.','Specify the time to purge the "%s" list.'=>'Bixi waqtiga lagu tirayo liiska "%s".','Current server time is %s.'=>'Waqtiga server-ka hadda wuxuu yahay %s.','A Purge All will be executed when WordPress runs these hooks.'=>'Markab Cusub ayaa la fulin doonaa marka WordPress uu wado qabsatooyinkan.','Specify how long, in seconds, public pages are cached.'=>'Sheeg muddada, ilbiriqsiyo, ee bogagga dadweynaha la kaydiyo.','Specify how long, in seconds, private pages are cached.'=>'Qeex muddada, ilbiriqsiyo, ay bogagga gaarka ahi kaydsan yihiin.','Specify how long, in seconds, the front page is cached.'=>'Sheeg muddada, ilbidhiqsi ahaan, ee bogga hore la kaydiyo.','Specify how long, in seconds, feeds are cached.'=>'Sheeg muddada, ilbiriqsiyo, ee la kaydiyo xogta quudinta.','If this is set to a number less than 30, feeds will not be cached.'=>'Haddii tan loo asteeyo nambar ka yar 30, quudinta lama kaydin doono.','Specify how long, in seconds, REST calls are cached.'=>'Cadee inta ay leeg tahay, ilbidhiqsi ahaan, inta ay wicitaanada REST keydsan yihiin.','Specify an HTTP status code and the number of seconds to cache that page, separated by a space.'=>'Sheeg nambarka xaaladda HTTP iyo tirada ilbiriqsiyada ee lagu keydinayo boggaas, adoo ku kala soocaya bannaan.','Browser Cache Settings'=>'Dejinta Kaydka Barowsarka','OpenLiteSpeed users please check this'=>'Isticmaalayaasha OpenLiteSpeed fadran tan hubiya','Setting Up Custom Headers'=>'Madax Gaarka ah oo la dejinayo','Browser caching stores static files locally in the user\'s browser. Turn on this setting to reduce repeated requests for static files.'=>'Kaydinta biraawsarku waxay faylasha taagan ku kaydisaa maxalli ahaan biraawsarka isticmaalaha. Shid dejintan si aad u yareyso codsiyada soo noqnoqda ee faylasha taagan.','You can turn on browser caching in server admin too. %sLearn more about LiteSpeed browser cache settings%s.'=>'Waxaa kale që aad shidmi kartaa kaydinta biraawsarka (browser caching) maamulaha adeejaha (server admin). %sBaro wax badan oo ku saabsan habaynta kaydka biraawsarka ee LiteSpeed%s.','The amount of time, in seconds, that files will be stored in browser cache before expiring.'=>'Inta wakhtiga ah, ee ilbiriqsi ahaan, oo faylasha lagu keydin doonaa kaydka barowsarka ka hor intaanay dhicin.','Ignore certain query strings when caching. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Iska indhat-tir su\'aalaha gaarka ah marka la kaydinayo (LSWS %s ayaa loo baahan yahay)','For example, to drop parameters beginning with %1$s, %2$s can be used here.'=>'Tusaale ahaan, si aad u tirtirto cabbirrada ka bilaabmaya %1$s, %2$s ayaa halkan looga isticmaali karaa.','Serve a separate cache copy for mobile visitors.'=>'U adeeg nuqul kayd ah oo gaar ah booqdayaasha mobeelka.','Learn more about when this is needed'=>'Baro wax badan oo ku saabsan goorta tani loo baahan yahay','Htaccess did not match configuration option.'=>'Htaccess uma dhigmo ikhtiyaarka qaabeynta.','Htaccess rule is: %s'=>'Xeerka Htaccess waa: %s','If %1$s is %2$s, then %3$s must be populated!'=>'Haddii %1$s uu yahay %2$s, markaa %3$s waa in la buuxiyaa!','cookies'=>'buskud','user agents'=>'wakiilada isticmaalaha','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive. MUST BE UNIQUE FROM OTHER WEB APPLICATIONS.'=>'SYNTAX: xarfaha iyo nambarada iyo "_". Meelbanaan ma laha waana xasaasi. WAXAA WAAYEL AH INUU GAAR AH YAHAY OO KANU DUWAN YAHAY CODSIYADA KALE EE WEBKA.','The default login cookie is %s.'=>'Buskudka gelitaanka ee caadiga ah waa %s.','The server will determine if the user is logged in based on the existence of this cookie.'=>'Seerfuhu wuxuu go\'aamin doonaa in isticmaalehu uu soo galay iyo in kale iyadoo lagu saleynayo jiritaanka buskudkan.','This setting is useful for those that have multiple web applications for the same domain.'=>'Dejintani waxay faa\'iido u leedahay kuwa haysta codsiyo shabakadeed oo badan oo isku domain ah.','If every web application uses the same cookie, the server may confuse whether a user is logged in or not.'=>'Haddii codsi kasta oo shabakaddu uu isticmaalo buskudka la mid ah, server-ku wuxuu ku wareeri karaa in isticmaale uu soo galay iyo in kale.','The cookie set here will be used for this WordPress installation.'=>'Buskudka halkan la dhigay waxaa loo isticmaali doonaa rakibiddan WordPress.','Example use case:'=>'Tusaalaha kiiska adeegsiga:','There is a WordPress installed for %s.'=>'Waxaa jira WordPress ku rakiban %s.','Then another WordPress is installed (NOT MULTISITE) at %s'=>'Markaaas WordPress kale ayaa lagu rakibay (MA AH MULTISITE) %s','The cache needs to distinguish who is logged into which WordPress site in order to cache correctly.'=>'Keydka waa in uu kala saaraa cidda ku gashay mid kasta oo ka mid ah mareegaha WordPress si uu si sax ah u keydiyo.','Invalid login cookie. Invalid characters found.'=>'Bushkuleerka gelitaanka ee khaldan. Waxaa la helay xarfo aan ansax ahayn.','WARNING: The .htaccess login cookie and Database login cookie do not match.'=>'DIGTOONI: Kukiyada gelitaanka ee .htaccess iyo kukiyada gelitaanka Database-ka isma waafaqsana.','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive.'=>'DHISMAHA: xarfaha iyo nambarada iyo "_". Meel bannaan ma leh xarfaha weyn iyo kuwa yarina waa kuwo kala duwan.','You can list the 3rd party vary cookies here.'=>'Halkan waxaad ku qori kartaa buskudka kala duwanaanshaha ee dhinac তৃতীয় (3rd party).','Enabled'=>'Daaran','Disabled'=>'La joojiyay','Not Available'=>'Lama Helo','Passed'=>'Gudbayay','Failed'=>'Waa fashilmay','Object Cache Settings'=>'Dejinta Keydka Shayga','Use external object cache functionality.'=>'Isticmaal shaqeynta kaydinta walxaha dibadda.','Status'=>'Xaaladda','%s Extension'=>'%s Kordhinta','Connection Test'=>'Tijaabada Isku Xirka','Your %s Hostname or IP address.'=>'Hostname-kaaga ama ciwaankaaga IP ee %s.','If you are using a %1$s socket, %2$s should be set to %3$s'=>'Haddii aad isticmaalayso %1$s socket, %2$s waa in loo dejiyo %3$s','Default port for %1$s is %2$s.'=>'Deegaanka %1$s dekedda caadiga ah waa %2$s.','Default TTL for cached objects.'=>'Astaamaha keydka ah ee kaydsan (TTL) ee caadiga ah.','Only available when %s is installed.'=>'Waxaa la heli karaa oo keliya marka %s la rakibo.','Specify the password used when connecting.'=>'Geli eraysirka la adeegsanayo marka la xiriirayo.','Database to be used'=>'Macluumaadka xogta ee la isticmaalayo','Groups cached at the network level.'=>'Kooxaha waxaa lagu keydiyay heerka shabakadda.','Use keep-alive connections to speed up cache operations.'=>'Isticmaal xiriiriyeyaasha keep-alive si aad u dedejiso hawlgallada keydka (cache).','Improve wp-admin speed through caching. (May encounter expired data)'=>'Horumar xawaaraha wp-admin adigoo isticmaalaya keydinta (caching). (Waxaa laga yaabaa inaad la kulanto xog dhacday)','When enabled, the cache will automatically purge when any plugin, theme or the WordPress core is upgraded.'=>'Markaa la shaqeysiiyo, kaydka (cache) si otomaatig ah ayuu u nadiifin doonaa marka la cusboonaysiinayo wixii plugin ah, mawduuc ah, ama WordPress core ah.','Cloudflare Settings'=>'Dejinta Cloudflare','Use %s API functionality.'=>'Isticmaal %s API shaqayntiisa.','Global API Key / API Token'=>'Furaha API Caalamiga ah / Astaanta API','Your API key / token is used to access %s APIs.'=>'Furahaaga API / calaamadda waxaa loo isticmaalaa in lagu galo %s API-yada.','Get it from %s.'=>'Ka hel %s.','Recommended to generate the token from Cloudflare API token template "WordPress".'=>'Waxaa lagula talinayaa in aad token-ka ka soo saarto Cloudflare API token qaab-dhismeedka "WordPress".','Email Address'=>'Ciwaanka iimaylka','Your Email address on %s.'=>'Ciwaankaaga iimaylka ee ku yaal %s.','Optional when API token used.'=>'Ikhtiyaari ah marka la isticmaalayo API token.','Domain'=>'Degell','You can just type part of the domain.'=>'Waxa aad si fudud u qori kartaa qayb ka mid ah domain-ka.','Once saved, it will be matched with the current list and completed automatically.'=>'Markii la kaydiyo, waxa lala mid dhigayaa liiska hadda jira oo si otomaatig ah ayaa loo dhammaystirayaa.','Clear %s cache when "Purge All" is run.'=>'Markabka %s nadiifi marka "Purge All" la socodsiiyo.','To enable the following functionality, turn ON Cloudflare API in CDN Settings.'=>'Si aad u suurtageliso shaqaynta soo socota, shid Cloudflare API ee Dejinta CDN.','Cloudflare Domain'=>'Cloudflare Domain','Cloudflare Zone'=>'Cloudflare Zone','Development Mode'=>'Habka Horumarinta','Turn ON'=>'Daar','Turn OFF'=>'Bakii','Check Status'=>'Hubi Xaaladda','Current status is %1$s since %2$s.'=>'Xaaladda hadda jirta waa %1$s ilaa %2$s.','Current status is %s.'=>'Xaaladda hadda jirta waa %s.','Development mode will be automatically turned off in %s.'=>'Habka horumarinta waxaa si otomaatig ah loo damin doonaa %s gudahood.','Temporarily bypass Cloudflare cache. This allows changes to the origin server to be seen in realtime.'=>'Ku meel gaar ah u dhaaaf kaydka Cloudflare. Tani waxay u oggolaaneysaa in isbeddellada ku yimaada server-ka asalka ah la arko waqtiga dhabta ah.','Development Mode will be turned off automatically after three hours.'=>'Habka Horumarinta waxaa si otomaatig ah loo damin doonaa saddex saacadood ka dib.','%1$sLearn More%2$s'=>'%1$sWax badan Baro%2$s','Cloudflare Cache'=>'Cloudflare Cache','Purge Everything'=>'Tirtir Wax Walba','Other Static CDN'=>'CDN-ka kale ee Istaraatiijiga ah','Zinn® Cache Engine CDN'=>'Mashiinka Cache-ka ee Zinn® CDN','CDN Settings'=>'Dejinta CDN','Turn this setting %s if you are using a traditional Content Delivery Network (CDN) or a subdomain for static content.'=>'Daar dejintakan %s haddii aad isticmaasho Shabakad Bixinta Nuxurka (CDN) ee caadiga ah ama hoosaad (subdomain) loogu talagalay nuxurka taagan.','NOTE: Cloudflare does not use CDN Mapping. If you are only using Cloudflare, leave this setting %s.'=>'FIIRO GAAR AH: Cloudflare ma isticmaasho Khariideynta CDN. Haddii aad kaliya isticmaalayso Cloudflare, dejintan u daa %s.','To randomize CDN hostname, define multiple hostnames for the same resources.'=>'Si aad u kala beddesho magaca martigeliyaha CDN, qeex magacyo badan oo martigeliye ah oo loogu talagalay agabka la mid ah.','Serve all image files through the CDN. This will affect all attachments, HTML %1$s tags, and CSS %2$s attributes.'=>'Dhammaan faylasha sawirrada uga adeegso CDN-ka. Tani waxay saameyn doontaa dhammaan lifaaqyada, calaamadaha HTML-ka ee %1$s, iyo sifooyinka CSS-ka ee %2$s.','Serve all CSS files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP CSS files.'=>'Dhammaan faylasha CSS-ka ku adeegso CDN-ka. Tani waxay saameyn doontaa dhammaan faylasha WP CSS ee safka ku jira.','Serve all JavaScript files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP JavaScript files.'=>'Dhammaan faylasha JavaScript-ka ku adeegso CDN-ka. Tani waxay saameyn doontaa dhammaan faylasha WP JavaScript ee safka ku jira.','Static file type links to be replaced by CDN links.'=>'Noocyada faylasha static-ka ah ee lagu beddelayo xiriiriyeyaasha CDN.','This will affect all tags containing attributes: %s.'=>'Tani waxay saameyn doontaa dhammaan calaamadaha ay ku jiraan sifooyinka: %s.','If you turn any of the above settings OFF, please remove the related file types from the %s box.'=>'Haddii aad damiso mid ka mid ah goobaha kore, fadlan ka saar noocyada faylasha ee la xiriira sanduuqa %s.','Specify which HTML element attributes will be replaced with CDN Mapping.'=>'Qeex sifooyinka curiyaha HTML ee lagu beddelayo Khariideynta CDN.','Only attributes listed here will be replaced.'=>'Kaliya sifooyinka halkan ku xusan ayaa la bedeli doonaa.','Use the format %1$s or %2$s (element is optional).'=>'Adeegso qaabka %1$s ama %2$s (curiyuhu waa ikhtiyaari).','Site URL to be served through the CDN. Beginning with %1$s. For example, %2$s.'=>'URL-ka goobta ee la marinayo CDN. Ka billow %1$s. Tusaale ahaan, %2$s.','Only files within these directories will be pointed to the CDN.'=>'Kaliya faylasha ku dhex jira galkan ayaa loo tilmaami doonaa CDN-ka.','Paths containing these strings will not be served from the CDN.'=>'Waddooyinka ka kooban xadhigyadan lagama adeegi doono CDN.','Are you sure to delete all existing blocklist items?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad tirtirto dhammaan walxaha liiska madow ee jira?','Empty blocklist'=>'Liiska madoow ee madhan','Blocklist'=>'Liiska xannibaadda','Total'=>'Wadarta','URL'=>'URL','Operation'=>'Hawlgal','Remove from Blocklist'=>'Ka saar Liiska Madow','API: PHP Constant %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: PHP Constant %s waa loo heli karaa si loo damiyo liiska laga mamnuucay.','API: Filter %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: Sifeeyaha %s waa la heli karaa si loo damiyo liiska madow.','Not blocklisted'=>'Liiska madoow kuma jiro','Blocklisted due to not cacheable'=>'Waa la xannibay sababtoo ah lama kaydin karo','Blocklisted'=>'Liiska madowga la saaray','Summary'=>'Kooban','Map'=>'Khariirad','Zinn® Cache Engine Crawler'=>'Nidaamka Crawler-ka ee Mashiinka Cache-ka Zinn®','Clean Crawler Map'=>'Nadiifi Khariidadda Iskuxiraha','Refresh Crawler Map'=>'Cusboonaysii Khariidadda C Crawler-ka','Generated at %s'=>'Waxaa la soo saaray %s','Sitemap List'=>'Liiska Khariidadda Bogga','Sitemap Total'=>'Wadarta Khariidadda Goobta','URL Search'=>'Raadinta URL-ka','Cache Hit'=>'Kulan Keydka (Cache Hit)','Cache Miss'=>'Cache Miss','Crawler Status'=>'Xaaladda Cilmibaaraha','Add to Blocklist'=>'Ku dar liiska xannibaadda','Crawler General Settings'=>'Uhabaynta Guud ee Crawl-ka','This will enable crawler cron.'=>'Tani waxay suurtagelin doontaa cron-ka gurguuraha.','Specify how long in seconds before the crawler should initiate crawling the entire sitemap again.'=>'Cabbir muddada ilbiriqsadaha ah ee ay tahay in gurguuraha uu dib ugu bilaabo gurguurashada khariidadda mareegaha oo dhan.','The crawler will use your XML sitemap or sitemap index. Enter the full URL to your sitemap here.'=>'Crawl-aha wuxuu isticmaali doonaa sitemap-kaaga XML ama fekerka sitemap-ka. Halkan ku geli URL-ka buuxa ee sitemap-kaaga.','Server enforced value: %s'=>'Qiimaha uu ku khasbay adeegaha: %s','Server allowed max value: %s'=>'Qiimaha ugu sarreeya ee server-ku oggol yahay: %s','To crawl the site as a logged-in user, enter the user ids to be simulated.'=>'Si aad ugu gurguurato bogga adoo ah isticmaale soo galay, geli aqoonsiyada isticmaalaha ee la doonayo in la matalo.','You must set %s before using this feature.'=>'Waa inaad dejisaa %s ka hor inta aanad isticmaalin sifadan.','Click here to set.'=>'Riix halkan si aad u dejiso.','You must set %1$s to %2$s before using this feature.'=>'Waa inaad u dejiso %1$s ilaa %2$s ka hor inta aanad isticmaalin sifadan.','To crawl for a particular cookie, enter the cookie name, and the values you wish to crawl for. Values should be one per line. There will be one crawler created per cookie value, per simulated role.'=>'Si aad u raadiso buskut gaar ah, geli magaca buskutka, iyo qiyamka aad rabto inaad ka raadiso. Qiyamku waa inay ahaadaan hal halkii saf. Waxaa jiri doona hal baadi-doon oo loo sameeyo qiime kasta oo buskut ah, halkii door ee la jilay.','Use %1$s in %2$s to indicate this cookie has not been set.'=>'Isticmaal %1$s gudaha %2$s si aad u muujiso in buskudkan aan la dejin.','You need to set the %s in Settings first before using the crawler'=>'Waxaad u baahan tahay inaad Dejinta ku bilowdo %s ka hor inta aadan isticmaalin qodaha','Crawler Cron'=>'Crawler Cron','The crawler feature is not enabled on the LiteSpeed server. Please consult your server admin or hosting provider.'=>'Aruuriyaha (crawler) ma shaqeeyo adeegaha LiteSpeed. Fadlan la tasho maamulaha adeegahaaga ama shirkaddaada martigelinta.','See %sIntroduction for Enabling the Crawler%s for detailed information.'=>'Eeg %sHordhaca Sahliyo Scraper-ka (Crawler)%s wixii macluumaad dheeraad ah.','Current sitemap crawl started at'=>'Gurguuraha sitemap-ka ee hadda wuxuu billowday','The next complete sitemap crawl will start at'=>'Gurguurka xiga ee bogga oo dhameystiran wuxuu bilaaban doonaa','Last complete run time for all crawlers'=>'Waqtiga ugu dambeeya ee dhammaystirka dhammaan gurguurayaasha','%d seconds'=>'%d ilbiriqsi','Run time for previous crawler'=>'Waqtiga shaqada ee gurguuraha hore','Current crawler started at'=>'Xirmaha hadda jira wuxuu bilaabmay','Current server load'=>'Culayska adeegaha ee hadda','Last interval'=>'Kormeerkii ugu dambeeyay','Ended reason'=>'Sababta dhamaadka','Last crawled'=>'Keyntii ugu dambaysay','%d item(s)'=>'%d shay (shaqo)','Reset position'=>'Dib u deji booska','Manually run'=>'Gacanta ku soco','Cron Name'=>'Magaca Cron','Run Frequency'=>'Sonoqashada Socodsiinta','Activate'=>'Hawlgeli','Running'=>'Socota','Waiting'=>'Sugaya','Hit'=>'Riix','Miss'=>'Maqan','Position: '=>'Booska:','running'=>'socota','Waiting to be Crawled'=>'Waxaa la sugayaa in la cuno','Already Cached'=>'Horay loo kaydiyay','Successfully Crawled'=>'Si guul leh loo baaray','Run frequency is set by the Interval Between Runs setting.'=>'Isku-socodka joogtaynta waxaa dejiya goobta Iscodka u dhexeeya Isku-socodyada.','Crawlers cannot run concurrently. If both the cron and a manual run start at similar times, the first to be started will take precedence.'=>'Makiinado crawler-ka ah uma shaqayn karaan si isku mar ah. Haddii labada cron iyo hawlgelinta gacanta ay ku bilowdaan wakhtiyo isku dhow, kan horta bilaabma ayaa la siin doonaa mudnaanta.','Please see %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s to learn how to create the system cron task.'=>'Fadlan eeg %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s si aad barato sida loo sameeyo hawsha cron ee nidaamka.','Watch Crawler Status'=>'La Soco Xaaladda Cilmibaaraha','Show crawler status'=>'Muuji xaaladda crawler-ka','Start watching...'=>'Bilow daawashada...','No crawler meta file generated yet'=>'Weli lama soo saarin faylka meta ee ciraawalka (crawler).','Cache Status'=>'Xaaladda Kaydka','More'=>'In ka badan','Public Cache'=>'Kaydka Dadweynaha','Private Cache'=>'Kaydka Khaaska ah','Crawler(s)'=>'Crawler(s)','Currently active crawler'=>'So-xaqiiq ah ee hadda shaqaynaysa','%1$s %2$d item(s)'=>'%1$s %2$d shay(o)','Last crawled:'=>'Markii ugu dambaysay ee la crmiyay:','News'=>'Wararka','Network Dashboard'=>'Dashboard-ka Shabakadda','Zinn® Cache Engine Dashboard'=>'Guddiga Xakamaynta Kaydka ee Zinn®','Usage Statistics: %s'=>'Isticmaalka Tirakoobka: %s','CDN Bandwidth'=>'CDN bandwidth','Low Quality Image Placeholder'=>'Meel-dhigaha Sawirka Tayada Hooseeya','Fast Queue Usage'=>'Isticmaalka Safka Degdegga ah','Usage'=>'Isticmaalka','Pay as You Go'=>'Lacag bixi intaad isticmaasho','PAYG Balance'=>'Hadhaaga PAYG','This Month Usage: %s'=>'Isticmaalka Bishan: %s','Pay as You Go Usage Statistics'=>'Isticmaalka Bixinta Inta Aad Isticmaasho (Pay as You Go) Tirakoobka','Total Usage'=>'Wadarta Isticmaalka','Total images optimized in this month'=>'Wadarta sawirrada ee la hagaajiyay bishan','DB Optimization Settings'=>'Dejinta Hagaajinta DB','Zinn® Cache Engine Database Optimization'=>'Zinn® Engine-ka Kaydka Ku-meel-gaarka ah Wanaajinta Xog-haynta','Clean All'=>'Nadiifi Dhammaan','Post Revisions'=>'Dib-u-eegisyada Qoraalka','Clean all post revisions'=>'Nadiifi dhammaan dib-u-eegisyada qoraalka','Orphaned Post Meta'=>'Qoraalka Meta ee Agoonta ah','Clean all orphaned post meta records'=>'Nadiifi dhammaan diiwaannada meta ee boostada ah ee la waayay waalidkood','Auto Drafts'=>'Qabyooyinka Tooska ah','Clean all auto saved drafts'=>'Nadiifi dhammaan qabyo-qoraallada si otomaatig ah loo keydiyay','Trashed Posts'=>'Qoraallada la tirtiray','Clean all trashed posts and pages'=>'Nadiifi dhammaan qoraallada iyo bogagga la masaxay','Spam Comments'=>'Faallooyinka Spam-ka','Clean all spam comments'=>'Nadiifi dhammaan faallooyinka spam-ka','Trashed Comments'=>'Faallooyinka la tirtiray','Clean all trashed comments'=>'Tirtir dhammaan faallooyinka qashinka ah','Trackbacks/Pingbacks'=>'Trackbacks/Pingbacks','Clean all trackbacks and pingbacks'=>'Tirtir dhammaan trackbacks iyo pingbacks','Expired Transients'=>'Ka Dhacay Transients','Clean expired transient options'=>'Nadiifi xulashooyinka ku meel-gaarka ah ee dhacay','All Transients'=>'Dhammaan Ku-me-gaarka ah','Clean all transient options'=>'Tirtir dhammaan xulashooyinka ku-meel-gaarka ah','Optimize Tables'=>'Miiska Hagaaji','Optimize all tables in your database'=>'Fanaadi dhammaan jadwalka ku jira xog-ururintaada','Clean revisions older than %1$s day(s), excluding %2$s latest revisions'=>'Nadiifi dib-u-eegisyada ka da\'weyn %1$s maalmood, adoo ka reeban %2$s dib-u-eegisyada ugu dambeeya','Database Optimizer'=>'Hagaajiye Kaydka Xogta','Database Table Engine Converter'=>'Beddelaha Mashiinka Miiska Kaydka Xogta','Table'=>'Shaxda','Engine'=>'Mashiinka','Tool'=>'Qalab','Convert to InnoDB'=>'U beddel InnoDB','We are good. No table uses MyISAM engine.'=>'Waan fiicannahay. Ma jiro miisas isticmaala matoorka MyISAM.','Database Summary'=>'Kooban Xogta Kaydka','Autoload size'=>'Cabbirka rarka tooska ah','Autoload entries'=>'Qoraallada is-ku-shubashada-otomaatiga ah','Autoload top list'=>'Liiska ugu sarreeya ee iswada','Option Name'=>'Magaca Xulashada','Autoload'=>'Soo rarid toos ah','Size'=>'Cabbirka','Specify the number of most recent revisions to keep when cleaning revisions.'=>'Sheeg tirada dib-u-eegisyada ugu dambeeya ee la haynayo marka la nadiifinayo dib-u-eegisyada.','Day(s)'=>'Maalin (maalmaha)','Revisions newer than this many days will be kept when cleaning revisions.'=>'Hababkii ka cusub intan oo maalmood ayaa la hayn doonaa marka la nadiifinayo hababka.','Public'=>'Dadweyne','Private'=>'Gaar ah','Disable'=>'Jooji','Widget Cache TTL'=>'Qasgalka Khayraadka Widget-ka (TTL)','Recommended value: 28800 seconds (8 hours).'=>'Qiimaha lagu taliyay: 28800 ilbiriqsi (8 saacadood).','A TTL of 0 indicates do not cache.'=>'TTL oo ah 0 waxay muujineysaa inaysan kaydin (cache) la sameyn.','General Settings'=>'Dejinta Guud','Zinn® Cache Engine General Settings'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Goobaha Guud','Use Primary Site Configuration'=>'Adeegso Qaabeynta Goobta Koowaad','Check this option to use the primary site\'s configuration for all subsites.'=>'Xulo ikhtiyaarkan si aad u isticmaasho habeynta mareegta koowaad dhammaan mareegaha hoose.','This will disable the settings page on all subsites.'=>'Tani waxay damin doontaa bogga dejinta ee dhammaan hoos-bogocyada.','This option enables maximum optimization for Guest Mode visitors.'=>'Xulashankani wuxuu suurt gelinayaa habaynta ugu sarraysa ee booqdayaasha Habka Martida.','Please read all warnings before enabling this option.'=>'Fadlan akhri dhammaan digniinaha ka hor intaanad awood gelin xulkan.','Notice'=>'Ogeysiis','%s must be turned ON for this setting to work.'=>'%s waa in la shaqaysiiyaa si ay dejintani u shaqeyso.','You need to turn %s on to get maximum result.'=>'Waxaad u baahan tahay inaad shiddo %s si aad u hesho natiijada ugu badan.','You need to turn %s on and finish all WebP generation to get maximum result.'=>'Waxaad u baahan tahay inaad shiddo %s oo aad dhammaystirto dhammaan abuurista WebP si aad u hesho natiijada ugu badan.','Enter this site\'s IP address to allow cloud services directly call IP instead of domain name. This eliminates the overhead of DNS and CDN lookups.'=>'Geli cinwaanka IP-ga ee boggan si aad ugu oggolaato adeegyada daruuriga ah inay si toos ah ugu yeeraan IP halkii ay ka ahaan lahaayeen magaca domainka. Tani waxay meesha ka saaraysaa culayska DNS iyo raadinta CDN.','Your server IP'=>'IP-ga serverkaaga','Check my public IP from'=>'Ka hubi IP-gayga guud ee','the auto-detected IP may not be accurate if you have an additional outgoing IP set, or you have multiple IPs configured on your server.'=>'IP-ga otomaatig loo ogaaday waxaa laga yaabaa inuusan sax ahayn haddii aad leedahay IP kale oo ka baxaya oo la dejiyay, ama aad ku leedahay IP-yo badan oo lagu habeeyay adiga server-kaaga.','Please make sure this IP is the correct one for visiting your site.'=>'Fadlan hubi in IP-gani uu yahay kan saxda ah ee lagu booqanayo boggaaga.','Turn this option ON to show latest news automatically, including hotfixes, new releases, available beta versions, and promotions.'=>'Shid doorashadan si aad si toos ah ugu muujiso wararkii ugu dambeeyay, oo ay ku jiraan hagaajinta cayayaanka, sii-deynta cusub, noocyada beta ee la heli karo, iyo xayaysiisyada.','Turn this option ON to have Zinn® Cache Engine updated automatically, whenever a new version is released. If OFF, update manually as usual.'=>'Daar dooralkan si aad u hesho in Zinn® Cache Engine si otomaatig ah loo cusboonaysiiyo mar kasta oo nooc cusub la soo saaro. Haddii uu dansan yahay, gacanta ku cusboonaysii sida caadiga ah.','Guest Mode provides an always cacheable landing page for an automated guest\'s first time visit, and then attempts to update cache varies via AJAX.'=>'Habka Martida waxa uu bixiyaa bilyal kaydsanaan karta mar kasta oo ay timaaddo booqashada ugu horreysa ee martida tooska ah, ka dibna waxa uu isku dayaa in uu ku cusboonaysiiyo kala duwanaanshaha kaydka (cache) AJAX iyada oo loo marayo.','This option can help to correct the cache vary for certain advanced mobile or tablet visitors.'=>'Tani waxay caawisaa in la saxo kala duwanaanshaha kaydka (cache vary) ee booqdayaasha qaarkood ee isticmaala mobiilada ama tablet-yada horumarsan.','Guest Mode testing result'=>'Natiijada tijaabada Qaabka Martida','Testing'=>'Tijaabinaya','Guest Mode IP/UA sync status'=>'Xaaladda sync-ga IP/UA ee Habka Martida','Syncing'=>'Isku-duwidda','Guest Mode passed testing.'=>'Habka martida wuxuu ku guuleystay tijaabinta.','Guest Mode failed to test.'=>'Qaabka Martida wuu ku guuldarraystay in la tijaabiyo.','Synced successfully.'=>'Si guul leh loo wada-sheegay.','Sync failed.'=>'Wuu guuldarraystay is-waafajinta.','Image Optimization Summary'=>'Soo Koobidda Kor u Qaadista Sawirka','Image Optimization Settings'=>'Dejinta Habeynta Sawirka','Zinn® Cache Engine Image Optimization'=>'Wanaajinta Sawirka ee Zinn® Cache Engine','Request WebP/AVIF versions of original images when doing optimization.'=>'Codso noocyada WebP/AVIF ee sawirrada asalka ah marka la sameynayo hagaajinta.','Significantly improve load time by replacing images with their optimized %s versions.'=>'Si weyn u wanaaji xawaaraha culayska adiga oo sawirrada ku beddelaya noocyadooda la hagaajiyay ee %s.','When switching formats, please %1$s or %2$s to apply this new choice to previously optimized images.'=>'Markii aad beddelayso qaababka, fadlan %1$s ama %2$s si aad doorashadan cusub ugu adeegto sawirrada horay loo sii hagaajiyay.','Destroy All Optimization Data'=>'Baabi\'i Dhammaan Xogta Hagaajinta','Soft Reset Optimization Counter'=>'Tiroobaha Hagaajinta Dib-u-dejinta Fudud','Automatically request optimization via cron job.'=>'Si toos ah u codso wanaajin adigoo isticmaalaya shaqada cron.','Optimize images and save backups of the originals in the same folder.'=>'Hagaaji sawirrada oo kaydi gurmadka asalka ah ee galka la mid ah.','Automatically remove the original image backups after fetching optimized images.'=>'Si otomaatika ah uga saar keydadka sawirka asalka ah ka dib marka aad soo qaadato sawirada la wanaajiyay.','This is irreversible.'=>'Tani waa mid aan la soo celin karin.','You will be unable to Revert Optimization once the backups are deleted!'=>'Ma awoodi doontid inaad dib u soo celiso hagaajinta marka kaydinta la tirtiro!','Optimize images using lossless compression.'=>'Sawirrada ku hagaaji cadaadis aan khasaare lahayn.','This can improve quality but may result in larger images than lossy compression will.'=>'Tani waxay horumarin kartaa tayada laakiin waxay keeni kartaa sawirro ka waaweyn kuwa uu soo saaro cadaadiska khasaaraha wata (lossy compression).','No sizes found.'=>'Lama helin wax cabbir ah.','Choose which image sizes to optimize.'=>'Dooro cabirrada sawirka ee la hagaajinayo.','Preserve EXIF data (copyright, GPS, comments, keywords, etc) when optimizing.'=>'Hagaaji xogta EXIF (xuquuqda daabacaadda, GPS, faallooyinka, kelmadaha muhiimka ah, iwm.) marka aad wanaajineysid.','This will increase the size of optimized files.'=>'Tani waxay kordhin doontaa cabbirka faylasha la wanaajiyay.','Specify which element attributes will be replaced with WebP/AVIF.'=>'Sheeg sifooyinka curiyaha ee lagu beddelayo WebP/AVIF.','Enable replacement of WebP/AVIF in %s elements that were generated outside of WordPress logic.'=>'Kicin beddelka WebP/AVIF ee walxaha %s ee laga soo saaray bannaanka caqli-galka WordPress.','Current closest Cloud server is %s. Click to redetect.'=>'Bishanka darajada darajada darajada ee Cloud waa %s. Guji si aad dib u ogaato.','Are you sure you want to redetect the closest cloud server for this service?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad dib uga ogaato server-ka daruuraha ee ugu dhow adeeggan?','Redetect'=>'Dib u ogaansho','Image optimisation'=>'Hagaajinta sawirka','You can request a maximum of %s images at once.'=>'Waxaad codsan kartaa ugu badnaan %s sawir markiiba.','To make sure our server can communicate with your server without any issues and everything works fine, for the few first requests the number of image groups allowed in a single request is limited.'=>'Si loo xaqiijiyo in adeegeenu uu si nabadgelyo ah ula xiriiri karo adeegaga isla markaana wax walba ay si habboon u shaqeeyaan, codsiyada ugu horreeya ee kooban, tirada kooxaha sawirrada ah ee la oggol yahay hal codsi gudahiisa waa la xaddidayaa.','Current limit is'=>'Hadda xadka waa','Send Optimization Request'=>'Dir Dalabka Hagaajinta','Available after %d second(s)'=>'Waxaa la heli karaa inta ka dambaysa %d ilbidhiqsi (iyo)','Only press the button if the pull cron job is disabled.'=>'Riix batoonka kaliya haddii shaqada jiidista ee cron ay curyaansantahay.','Images will be pulled automatically if the cron job is running.'=>'Sawirrada waxaa si toos ah loo soo jiidayaa haddii shaqada cron ay socoto.','Pull Images'=>'Sooji Sawirrada','Optimization Status'=>'Heerka Hagaajinta','When the optimisation server finishes, it notifies your site to pull the optimised images.'=>'Markabka hagaajinta markuu dhammeeyo, wuxuu ku ogeysiinayaa boggaaga inuu soo jiido sawirrada la hagaajiyay.','This process is automatic.'=>'Habraankan waa mid toos ah.','Last pull initiated by cron at %s.'=>'Jiidashadii ugu dambeysay waxaa bilaabay cron %s.','Storage Optimization'=>'Kaydinta oo la wanaajiyay','A backup of each image is saved before it is optimized.'=>'Nuqul ka mid ah sawir kasta waxaa la kaydiyaa ka hor intaan la wanaajin.','Last calculated'=>'Lagu xisaabiyay markii ugu dambaysay','Files'=>'Faylalka','Calculate Original Image Storage'=>'Xisaabi Kaydka Sawirka Asalka ah','Calculate Backups Disk Space'=>'Xisaabi Meesha Baaxadda Kaydka Kaabayaasha','Image Thumbnail Group Sizes'=>'Cabirrada Kooxaha Sawir-yaraha','Delete all backups of the original images'=>'Tirtir dhammaan keydadka sawirrada asalka ah','Last ran'=>'U dambeeyay ee la orodday','Saved'=>'La kaydiyey','Are you sure you want to remove all image backups?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad tirtirto dhammaan kaydinta sawirada?','Remove Original Image Backups'=>'Ka saar Kaydadka Sawirka Asalka ah','Image Information'=>'Macluumaadka Sawirka','Image groups total'=>'Wadarta kooxaha sawirrada','Congratulations, all gathered!'=>'Hambalyo, dhammaan waa la soo ururiyay!','What is a group?'=>'Waa maxay koox?','What is an image group?'=>'Waa maxay kooxda sawirrada?','Current image post id position'=>'Meesaha uu ku sugan yahay qoraalka sawirka ee hadda (post id)','Maximum image post id'=>'Aqoonsiga ugu sarreeya ee sawirka la soo geliyay','Scan for any new unoptimized image thumbnail sizes and resend necessary image optimization requests.'=>'Raadi cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka cusub ee aan la wanaajin oo dib u soo dir codsiyada wanaajinta sawirka ee lagama maarmaanka ah.','Rescan New Thumbnails'=>'Dib U Sawir Ganeededyada Cusub','Optimization Summary'=>'Sokoobitaanka Hagaajinta','Total Reduction'=>'Wadarta Dhimista','Images Pulled'=>'Sawirrada La Soo Jiidashay','Last Request'=>'Codsigii U Dambeeyay','Last Pulled'=>'Last Pulled','Results can be checked in %sMedia Library%s.'=>'Natiijooyinka waxaa lagu hubin karaa %sMaktabadda Warbaahinta%s.','Optimization Tools'=>'Qalabka Hagaajinta','You can quickly switch between using original (unoptimized versions) and optimized image files. It will affect all images on your website, both regular and webp versions if available.'=>'Waxaad si degdeg ah ugu bedeli kartaa inta u dhaxeysa isticmaalka faylasha sawirada asalka ah (kuwa aan la hagaajin) iyo kuwa la hagaajiyay. Waxay saameyn doontaa dhammaan sawirada ku jira mareegahaaga, labadaba noocyada caadiga ah iyo kuwa webp haddii ay diyaar yihiin.','Use original images (unoptimized) on your site'=>'Isticmaal sawirrada asalka ah (oo aan la wanaajin) bartaada webka','Use Original Files'=>'Isticmaal Faylasha Asalka ah','Switch back to using optimized images on your site'=>'Dib ugu noqo isticmaalka sawirrada la habeeyay ee boggaaga','Use Optimized Files'=>'Isticmaal Faylal La Hagaajiyay','This will reset the %1$s. If you changed WebP/AVIF settings and want to generate %2$s for the previously optimized images, use this action.'=>'Tani waxay dib u dejin doontaa %1$s. Haddii aad beddeshay dejinta WebP/AVIF oo aad rabto inaad abuurto %2$s sawirradii hore loo hagaajiyey, isticmaal falkan.','Are you sure to destroy all optimized images?'=>'Ma hubtaa in aad tirtirto dhammaan sawirrada la hagaajiyay?','Remove all previous image optimization requests/results, revert completed optimizations, and delete all optimization files.'=>'Ka saar dhammaan codsiyada/natiijooyinka kor u qaadista sawirka ee hore, dib ugu soo celi hagaajintii la dhammeeyey, oo tirtir dhammaan faylasha hagaajinta.','Read the upstream Zinn® Cache Engine documentation'=>'Akhriso dukumiintiga upstream Zinn® Cache Engine','Zinn Digital® support'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital®','Zinn® Cache Engine user guide'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha ee Zinn® Cache Engine','To use the caching functions you must have a LiteSpeed or OpenLiteSpeed web server with the LSCache module.'=>'Si aad u isticmaasho shaqooyinka kaydinta (caching), waa inaad haysataa adeegaha shabakadda (web server) ee LiteSpeed ama OpenLiteSpeed oo leh module-ka LSCache.','Please enable the LSCache Module at the server level, or ask your hosting provider.'=>'Fadlan awood sii Module LSCache ee heerka server-ka, ama weydiiso bixiyahaaga martigelinta.','Please enable Zinn® Cache Engine in the plugin settings.'=>'Fadlan ka yeelshii Zinn® Cache Engine goobaha qalabka-dheeraadka ah.','LSCache caching functions on this page are currently unavailable!'=>'Shaqooyinka kaydinta ee LSCache ee boggan hadda lama heli karo!','The network admin selected use primary site configs for all subsites.'=>'Maamulaha shabakadu wuxuu doortay isticmaalka qaab-dhismeedka goobta koowaad ee dhammaan hoos-goobyada.','The following options are selected, but are not editable in this settings page.'=>'Xulashooyinka soo socda waa la doortay, laakiin lagama bedeli karo boggan dejinta.','LiteSpeed cache plugin upgraded. Please refresh the page to complete the configuration data upgrade.'=>'LiteSpeed cache plugin wuu cusboonaysiiyay. Fadlan dib u cusboonaysii bogga si aad u dhammaystirto cusboonaysiinta xogta habaynta.','Deactivate Zinn® Cache Engine'=>'Damiso Zinn® Cache Engine','The deactivation is temporary'=>'Joojinta waa mid ku meelgaar ah','Site performance is worse'=>'Waxqabadka boggu waa mid liita','Plugin is too complicated'=>'Plugin-ka waa mid aad u dhib badan','Other'=>'Kuwo kale','Why are you deactivating the plugin?'=>'Maxaad u joojinaysaa qalabka (plugin-ka)?','On uninstall, all plugin settings will be deleted.'=>'Marka la tirtiro, dhammaan dejinta plugin-ka waa la tirtiri doonaa.','If you have used Image Optimization, please %sDestroy All Optimization Data%s first. NOTE: this does not remove your optimized images.'=>'Haddii aad isticmaashay Hagaajinta Sawirka (Image Optimization), fadlan marka hore %sBurburi Dhammaan Xogta Hagaajinta%s. FIIRO GAAR AH: tani kama saareyso sawiradaada la hagaajiyay.','Deactivate'=>'Demiibi','Deactivate plugin'=>'Demi taariyaha','Close popup'=>'Xir daaqada pop-up-ka','Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is installed!'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine plugin waa la rakibay!','This message indicates that the plugin was installed by the server admin.'=>'Farrintani waxay muujinaysaa in qalabka dheeriga ah uu rakibay maamulka server-ka.','The Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is used to cache pages - a simple way to improve the performance of the site.'=>'Qalabka Zinn® Cache Engine waxaa loo isticmaalaa in lagu kaydiyo boggaga — waa hab fudud oo lagu wanaajiyo waxqabadka mareegta.','However, there is no way of knowing all the possible customizations that were implemented.'=>'Si kastaba ha ahaatee, ma jirto hab lagu ogaan karo dhammaan habaynta suurtagalka ah ee la hirgeliyay.','For that reason, please test the site to make sure everything still functions properly.'=>'Sababtaas awgeed, fadlan tijaabi barta si aad u hubiso in wax walba ay si sax ah weli u shaqeynayaan.','Examples of test cases include:'=>'Tusaalooyinka kiisaska tijaabada waxaa ka mid ah:','Visit the site while logged out.'=>'Booqo goobta adoo ka baxsan (logged out).','Create a post, make sure the front page is accurate.'=>'Abuur qoraal, hubi in bogga hore uu sax yahay.','If there are any questions, the team is always happy to answer any questions on the %ssupport forum%s.'=>'Haddii ay jiraan wax su\'aalo ah, kooxdu waxay had iyo jeer ku faraxsan tahay inay ka jawaabto wixii su\'aalo ah ee ku saabsan %ssupport forum%s.','If you would rather not move at litespeed, you can deactivate this plugin.'=>'Haddii aadan jeclayn in aad u guurto litespeed, waxaad joojin kartaa furahan.','NOTICE: Database login cookie did not match your login cookie.'=>'OGEESIIS: Dufcadda gelitaanka xog-ururinta (database)aysan la mid ahayn dufcaddaada gelitaanka.','If the login cookie was recently changed in the settings, please log out and back in.'=>'Haddii buskudka gelitaanka (login cookie) dhawaan lagu beddelay dejinta, fadlan ka bax oo dib ugu soo gal.','If not, please verify the setting in the %sAdvanced tab%s.'=>'Haddii kale, fadlan xaqiiji dejinta ku jirta %sAdvanced tab%s.','If using OpenLiteSpeed, the server must be restarted once for the changes to take effect.'=>'Haddii aad isticmaalayso OpenLiteSpeed, waa in adeegaha dib loo bilaabo hal mar si ay isbeddelladu u dhaqangalaan.','Unexpected cache rule %2$s found in %1$s file. This rule may cause visitors to see old versions of pages due to the browser caching HTML pages. If you are sure that HTML pages are not being browser cached, this message can be dismissed. (%3$sLearn More%4$s)'=>'La helay xeer kayd ah oo aan la fileyn %2$s oo ku dhex jira faylka %1$s. Xeerkani waxa uu sababi karaa in booqashadayaashu ay arkaan noocyada duugga ah ee bogagga sababta oo ah biraawsarku waxa uu kaydiyaa bogagga HTML. Haddii aad hubto in aanay bogagga HTML biraawsarku kaydinayn, fariintan waa la iska indho-tiri karaa. (%3$sWax Dheeraad ah Baro%4$s)','OptimaX Summary'=>'Soo koobitaanka OptimaX','OptimaX Settings'=>'Dejinta OptimaX','Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX','Turn on OptimaX. This will automatically request your pages OptimaX result via cron job.'=>'Daar OptimaX. Tani waxay si otomaatig ah uga codsan doontaa natiijada OptimaX ee bogaggaaga adoo adeegsanaya cron job.','CSS Settings'=>'Dejinta CSS','JS Settings'=>'Dejinta JS','HTML Settings'=>'Dejinta HTML','Media Settings'=>'Dejinta Warbaahinta','VPI'=>'VPI','Media Excludes'=>'Warbaahinta Reeban','Localization'=>'Hagaajinta deegaanka','Tuning'=>'Hagaajinta','Zinn® Cache Engine Page Optimization'=>'Aaladda Kaydka ku Kooraysa Zinn® ee Wanaajinta Bogga','Please test thoroughly when enabling any option in this list. After changing Minify/Combine settings, please do a Purge All action.'=>'Fadlan si fiican u tijaabi markaad awoodsiineyso ikhtiyaar kasta oo ku jira liiskan. Ka dib markaad beddesho dejinta Minify/Combine, fadlan samee ficil ah Nadiifi Dhammaan (Purge All).','Minify CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'Yaree faylasha CSS-ka oo dhex geli koodhka CSS-ka.','Combine CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'Isku dar faylasha CSS-ka iyo koodka CSS-ka ee dhex-jiifa.','How to Fix Problems Caused by CSS/JS Optimization.'=>'Sida loo Xalliyo Dhibaatooyinka ay Keeneen Hagaajinta CSS/JS.','Generate unique CSS through an online generation service.'=>'So saar CSS gaar ah adigoo isticmaalaya adeeg online ah.','This will drop the unused CSS on each page from the combined file.'=>'Tani waxay ka saari doontaa CSS-ka aan la isticmaalin bog kasta oo ka yimid faylka la isku daray.','Automatic generation of unique CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Soosaarka tooska ah ee CSS gaar ah ayaa gadaal ka socota iyada oo la adeegsanayo saf ku salaysan cron.','Filter %s available for UCSS per page type generation.'=>'Sii shaandheeyaha %s ee la heli karo abuurista nooca bogagga ee UCSS.','This option is bypassed because %1$s option is %2$s.'=>'Xulashan waa laga tagay sababtoo ah %1$s xulashada waa %2$s.','Last generated'=>'U dambeeyay ee la sameeyay','Last requested cost'=>'Qiimihii ugu dambeeyay ee la codsaday','URL list in %s queue waiting for cron'=>'Liiska URL-ka ee ku jira safka %s ee sugaya cron','Clear'=>'Nadiifi','Run %s Queue Manually'=>'Gacanta ku soco safka %s','Inline UCSS to reduce the extra CSS file loading. This option will not be automatically turned on for %1$s pages. To use it on %1$s pages, please set it to ON.'=>'Gali UCSS si loo yareeyo xamuulka faylka CSS ee dheeraadka ah. Ikhtiyaarkan si otomaatig ah loogama shaqayn doono bogagga %1$s. Si aad ugu isticmaasho bogagga %1$s, fadlan u deji Shid (ON).','This option will automatically bypass %s option.'=>'Ikhtiyaarkan ayaa si otomaatig ah u dhaafi doona ikhtiyaarka %s.','Include external CSS and inline CSS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of CSS, which should minimize potential errors caused by CSS Combine.'=>'Ku dar CSS-ka dibadda iyo CSS-ka hoose faylka isku daray marka %1$s sidoo kale la daarto. Ikhtiyaarkani wuxuu caawiyaa ilaalinta mudnaanta CSS, taas oo yareyneysa khaladaadka suurtagalka ah ee ka dhalan kara CSS Combine.','Optimize CSS delivery.'=>'Hagaaji keenista CSS.','This can improve your speed score in services like Pingdom, GTmetrix and PageSpeed.'=>'Tani waxay hagaajin kartaa dhibcahaaga xawaaraha ee adeegyada sida Pingdom, GTmetrix iyo PageSpeed.','Generate critical CSS through an online generation service and load the remaining CSS asynchronously.'=>'CSS-ka muhiimka ah ku soo saar adeeg online ah oo lagu sameeyo, ka dibna CSS-ka soo haray si aan isku mid ahayn (asynchronously) u soo rar.','Automatic generation of critical CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Soo-saaridda tooska ah ee CSS-ka muhiimka ah waxay ku socotaa asalka iyada oo la adeegsanayo saf ku salaysan cron.','When this option is turned %s, it will also load Google Fonts asynchronously.'=>'Markasta oo ikhtiyaarkan la shido %s, waxay sidoo kale si aan waqti-wadaag ahayn u soo dejin doontaa Google Fonts.','Elements with attribute %s in HTML code will be excluded.'=>'Qaybaha leh sifada %s ee koodhka HTML waa laga reebi doonaa.','This option is bypassed due to %s option.'=>'Doorashashadan waa la dhaaafay sabab falleció awgeed %s doorashada.','Disable this option to generate CCSS per Post Type instead of per page. This can save significant CCSS quota, however it may result in incorrect CSS styling if your site uses a page builder.'=>'Demi doorashadan si aad u abuurto CCSS Nooca Boostada kasta halkii ay ka noqon lahayd bog kasta. Tani waxay badbaadin kartaa kootada CCSS ee muhiimka ah, si kastaba ha ahaatee waxay keeni kartaa qaabeyn CSS ah oo khaldan haddii boggagaagu uu isticmaalo dhise bog.','This will inline the asynchronous CSS library to avoid render blocking.'=>'Tani waxay ku dhex dari doontaa maktabadda CSS-ka ee aan isla-egayn (asynchronous) si looga fogaado in ay hortaagto rarista bogga (render blocking).','Default'=>'Caadi ah','Set this to append %1$s to all %2$s rules before caching CSS to specify how fonts should be displayed while being downloaded.'=>'Tan u deji si aad ugu darto %1$s dhammaan xeerarka %2$s ka hor inta aan la kaydin CSS si loo cayimiyo sida farta loogu bandhigayo inta la soo dejisanayo.','%s is recommended.'=>'Waxaa lagula talinayaa %s.','Swap'=>'Beddel','Minify HTML content.'=>'Yaree waxa ku jira HTML.','Prefetching DNS can reduce latency for visitors.'=>'Sii-sidashada DNS waxay yarayn kartaa daahitaanka booqdayaasha.','For example'=>'Tusaale ahaan','Automatically enable DNS prefetching for all URLs in the document, including images, CSS, JavaScript, and so forth.'=>'Si otomaatig ah ugu suurtageli DNS prefetching dhammaan URL-ada ku jira dukumentiga, oo ay ku jiraan sawirrada, CSS-ka, JavaScript, iyo wixii la mid ah.','This can improve the page loading speed.'=>'Tani waxay hagaajin kartaa xawaaraha raritaanka bogga.','Preconnecting speeds up future loads from a given origin.'=>'Isku-xirka hore wuxuu dedejiyaa culisyada mustaqbalka ee ka imanaya meel asal ah.','Delay rendering off-screen HTML elements by its selector.'=>'Dib u dhig bixinta curiyeyaasha HTML ee ka baxsan-shaashadda iyada oo loo marayo xulkeeda.','When minifying HTML do not discard comments that match a specified pattern.'=>'Marka la yaraynayo HTML-ka ha tuurin faallooyinka waafaqsan qaabka loo cayimay.','If comment to be kept is like: %1$s write: %2$s'=>'Haddii faallooyinka la haynayo ay yihiin sida: %1$s qor: %2$s','Remove query strings from internal static resources.'=>'Ka saar xargaha weydiinta ilaha gudaha ee taagan.','Google reCAPTCHA will be bypassed automatically.'=>'Google reCAPTCHA si otomaatik ah ayaa looga gudbi doonaa.','Append query string %s to the resources to bypass this action.'=>'Ku dar xadhigga su\'aasha %s kheyraadka si aad u dhaafto falkan.','Use Web Font Loader library to load Google Fonts asynchronously while leaving other CSS intact.'=>'Isticmaal maktabadda Web Font Loader si aad Google Fonts ugu shubtid si aan isku-xidhnayn adigoo CSS-ka kale u daynaya sidii uu ahaa.','This will also add a preconnect to Google Fonts to establish a connection earlier.'=>'Tani sido kale waxay ku dari doontaa preconnect Google Fonts si loo sameeyo xiriir horudhac ah.','Prevent Google Fonts from loading on all pages.'=>'Ka hortag in Google Fonts ay ku shubmaan dhammaan bogagga.','Stop loading WordPress.org emoji. Browser default emoji will be displayed instead.'=>'Jooji rarka WordPress.org emoji. Browser default emoji ayaa la soo bandhigi doonaa beddelkeeda.','This option will remove all %s tags from HTML.'=>'Xulashadani waxay ka saari doontaa dhammaan summadaha %s HTML.','Minify JS files and inline JS codes.'=>'Yaree faylasha JS kana dhex-geliso koodhadhka JS.','Combine all local JS files into a single file.'=>'Isku dar dhammaan faylasha JS ee maxalliga ah hal fayl oo keliya.','This option may result in a JS error or layout issue on frontend pages with certain themes/plugins.'=>'Doorashadani waxay sababi kartaa khalad JS ah ё xaalad qaabeynta bogagga hore leh mowduucyo/plugin-yo gaar ah.','JS error can be found from the developer console of browser by right clicking and choosing Inspect.'=>'Khaladaadka JS waxaa laga heli karaa qeybta horumariyaha ee biraawsarka adoo gujinaya dhinaca midig oo dooranaya Baadh (Inspect).','Include external JS and inline JS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of JS execution, which should minimize potential errors caused by JS Combine.'=>'Ku dar JS dibadda iyo JS gudaha ah faylka isku daray marka %1$s sidoo kale la daarto. Ikhtiyaarkani wuxuu caawinayaa ilaalinta mudnaanta fulinta JS, taas oo yareyn karta khaladaadka suurtagalka ah ee ay keento JS Combine.','Deferred'=>'Dib loo dhigay','Delayed'=>'Dib u dhacay','Deferring until page is parsed or delaying till interaction can help reduce resource contention and improve performance causing a lower FID (Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Dib u dhigista ilaa inta bogga la falanqeeyo ama dib u dhigidda ilaa inta la dhexgelayo waxay caawin kartaa dhimista loolanka agabka waxayna horumarin kartaa waxqabadka taasoo keenta FID hoose (cabbiraadda Core Web Vitals).','Failed to create Avatar table. Please follow <a %s>Table Creation guidance from LiteSpeed Wiki</a> to finish setup.'=>'Lagu guuldarrayey in la abuuro jadwalka Avatar. Fadlan raac <a %s>tilmaamaha abuurista jadwalka ee ka yimid LiteSpeed Wiki</a> si aad u dhammaystirto habaynta.','Localization Settings'=>'Dejinta Luqadda','Store Gravatar locally.'=>'Kaydi Gravatar maxalli ahaan.','Accelerates the speed by caching Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars).'=>'Waxay dedejisaa xawaaraha iyada oo kaydinaysa Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars).','Refresh Gravatar cache by cron.'=>'Cusboonaysii kaydka Gravatar adigoo adeegsanaya cron.','Avatar list in queue waiting for update'=>'Liiska Avatar-ka ee safka ku jira ee sugaya in la cusbooneysiiyo','Run Queue Manually'=>'Gacanta ku Soco Safka','Specify how long, in seconds, Gravatar files are cached.'=>'Qeex int a le\'eg, ilbiriqsiyo, Faylasha Gravatar loo keydiyo.','Localize external resources.'=>'Lokaleyso agabka dibadda.','Please thoroughly test all items in %s to ensure they function as expected.'=>'Fadlan si fiican u tijaabi dhammaan walxaha ku jira %s si aad u xaqiijiso inay u shaqeynayaan sidii la filayay.','Resources listed here will be copied and replaced with local URLs.'=>'Khayraadka halkan ku qoran waa la nuqulin doonaa waxaana lagu bedeli doonaa URL-yo maxalli ah.','HTTPS sources only.'=>'Ilaha HTTPS kaliya.','Comments are supported. Start a line with a %s to turn it into a comment line.'=>'Faallooyinka waa la taageeraa. Saf ka bilow %s si aad uga dhigto saf faallo ah.','Example'=>'Tusaale','Please thoroughly test each JS file you add to ensure it functions as expected.'=>'Fadlan tijaabi si fiican fayl kasta oo JS ah oo aad ku darto si aad u hubiso in uu u shaqeynayo sida loogu talagalay.','Load images only when they enter the viewport.'=>'So rar kaliya marka ay soo galaan muuqaalka (viewport).','This can improve page loading time by reducing initial HTTP requests.'=>'Tani waxay hagaajin kartaa xawaaraha culayska bogga iyadoo yareyneysa codsiyada HTTP ee bilowga ah.','Adding Style to Your Lazy-Loaded Images'=>'Ku Darista Habka Sawirradaada Lazy-Loaded','Specify a base64 image to be used as a simple placeholder while images finish loading.'=>'Caydi sawir base64 ah oo loo isticmaalo meel-marin fudud halka sawiradu ay dhammaanayaan soo dejinta.','This can be predefined in %2$s as well using constant %1$s, with this setting taking priority.'=>'Tan waxaa sidoo kale lagu sii qeexi karaa %2$s iyadoo la adeegsanayo joogtada %1$s, iyadoo dejintani ay mudnaan leedahay.','By default a gray image placeholder %s will be used.'=>'Si aad caadi ah loogu isticmaalo meel-marin sawir oo cawlan ah %s ayaa la isticmaali doonaa.','For example, %s can be used for a transparent placeholder.'=>'Tusaale ahaan, %s waxaa loo isticmaali karaa meel bannaan oo hufan.','Responsive image placeholders can help to reduce layout reshuffle when images are loaded.'=>'Meesayasha sawirka ee jawaabta celinta leh waxay caawisaa in la yareeyo leexashada qaab-dhismeedka marka sawirada la soo dejinayo.','This will generate the placeholder with same dimensions as the image if it has the width and height attributes.'=>'Tani waxay soo saari doontaa calaamadda meel-qabsiga ee cabbirrada ila mid ah sida sawirka haddii uu leeyahay sifooyinka ballaca iyo dhererka.','Specify an SVG to be used as a placeholder when generating locally.'=>'Sheeg SVG oo loo isticmaalo meel-hayte ahaan marka la dhalinayo maxalli ahaan.','It will be converted to a base64 SVG placeholder on-the-fly.'=>'Waxaa loo rogi doonaa boos-qabte base64 SVG ah si toos ah oo degdeg ah.','Variables %s will be replaced with the corresponding image properties.'=>'Dhinacyada %s waxaa lagu beddeli doonaa sifooyinka sawirka ee u dhigma.','Variables %s will be replaced with the configured background color.'=>'Isbeddelada %s waxaa lagu beddeli doonaa midabka asalka ah ee la habeeyay.','Specify the responsive placeholder SVG color.'=>'Sheeg midabka SVG ee meesha lagu hayo ee jawaabta leh.','Generate Low Quality Image Placeholders through an online generation service, for responsive image previews while loading.'=>'Samee Meelaha Sawirka Tayada Hooseeya adoo adeegsanaya adeeg abuurista khadka tooska ah, si loogu eego sawirka wax ka beddelka ah inta la soo dejinayo.','Keep this off to use plain color placeholders.'=>'Hayso tan si aad u isticmaasho meelaha bannaan ee midabka caadiga ah.','Specify the quality when generating LQIP.'=>'Sheeg tayada markaad abuureyso LQIP.','Larger number will generate higher resolution quality placeholder, but will result in larger files which will increase page size and consume more points.'=>'Tiro ka weyn waxay dhalin doontaa meel-qabte tayo sare leh oo xallin sare leh, laakiin waxay keeni doontaa faylal waaweyn oo kordhin doona cabbirka bogga isla markaana cuni doona dhibco badan.','Changes to this setting do not apply to already-generated LQIPs. To regenerate existing LQIPs, please %s first from the admin bar menu.'=>'Isbeddellada dejinta anagu ma khuseeyaan LQIP-yada horay loo sameeyay. Si aad dib ugu soo saarto LQIP-yada jira, fadlan marka hore %s ka bilow liiska baar-maamuleedka.','pixels'=>'pikselyo','LQIP requests will not be sent for images where both width and height are smaller than these dimensions.'=>'Codsashada LQIP lama diri doono sawirrada oo ballaca iyo dhererka labaduba ka yar yihiin cabbirradan.','Automatically generate LQIP in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Si otomatik ah ugu samee LQIP asalka adigoo isticmaalaya saf ku saleysan cron.','If set to %1$s, before the placeholder is localized, the %2$s configuration will be used.'=>'Haddii loo asteeyo %1$s, ka hor intaanay boos-qabashada la maxalliyeyn, habaynta %2$s ayaa la isticmaali doonaa.','If set to %s this is done in the foreground, which may slow down page load.'=>'Haddii loo asteeyo %s tan waxaa lagu fuliyaa asalka hore, taas oo gaabis ka dhigi karta soo dejinta bogga.','Size list in queue waiting for cron'=>'Cabbirka liiska ee safka sugaya cron','Load iframes only when they enter the viewport.'=>'So rar rak iframes kaliya marka ay soo galaan aragtida.','Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Joogto ballac iyo dherer cad ah oo ku yaal curiyeyaasha sawirka si aad u yareyso leexashada qaab-dhismeedka oo aad u hagaajiso CLS (cabbiraadda Core Web Vitals).','Use %1$s to bypass remote image dimension check when %2$s is ON.'=>'Isticmaal %1$s si aad uga gudubto hubinta cabbirka sawirka fog marka %2$s uu shaqeeyo.','The image compression quality setting of WordPress out of 100.'=>'Dejinta tayada ciriiriga sawirka ee WordPress oo ah 100kiiba.','Automatically replace large images with scaled versions.'=>'Si otomatig ah ugu beddel sawirrada waaweyn noocyo cabbirkooda la dhimay.','Scaled size threshold'=>'Heerka cabbirka la ballaariyey','Filter %s available to change threshold.'=>'Filter %s wuu diyaar yahay si loo beddelo xadka.','Listed images will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Sawirrada ku qoran lama soo dejin doono si caajis ah.','Useful for above-the-fold images causing CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Faa\'iido u leh sawirada kore ee keenaya CLS (qiyaasta Core Web Vitals).','Elements with attribute %s in html code will be excluded.'=>'Qaybaha leh sifada %s ee koodhka html waa la reebi doonaa.','Images containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Sawirrada wata magacyada fasalkan lagama rari doono si caajis ah.','Images having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Sawirrada leh magacyada fasalka waalidkan lagama rari doono si caajis ah.','Iframes containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Iframes-yada wata magacyada fasalkan lama rari doono si caajis ah.','Iframes having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Iframes-yada leh magacyada fasalka waalidka ah lama soo dejin doono si caajis ah.','Prevent any lazy load of listed pages.'=>'Ka hortag wax kasta oo ah in bogagga liiska ku jira dib loo soo raro.','These images will not generate LQIP.'=>'Sawirradani ma soo saari doonaan LQIP.','Tuning Settings'=>'Dejinta Habeynta','Listed JS files or inline JS code will be delayed.'=>'Faylasha JS ee la taxay ama koodka JS ee gudaha ku jira waa la daahin doonaa.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Faylasha JS ee la taxay ama koodka JS ee gudaha ku jira lama koobi doono ama lama mideyn doono.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings.'=>'Liiska horay loo qeexay ayaa sidoo kale lagu dari doonaa habaynta kor ku xusan.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be deferred or delayed.'=>'Faylasha JS ee la taxay ama koodka JS ee gudaha ku jira lama dib dhigi doono ama lama waqtiguu marin doono.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be optimized by %s.'=>'Faylasha JS ee la taxay ama koodka JS ee gudaha ku jira lama optimizayn doono %s.','Prevent any optimization of listed pages.'=>'Ka hortag wax kasta oo kor loogu qaadayo bogagka ku qoran liiska.','Only optimize pages for guest (not logged in) visitors. If turned this OFF, CSS/JS/CCSS files will be doubled by each user group.'=>'Kaliya wanaaji bogagga loogu talagalay martida (kuwa aan soo gelin). Haddii aad damiso tan, faylasha CSS/JS/CCSS waxaa laban-laabi doona koox kasta oo isticmaale ah.','Selected roles will be excluded from all optimizations.'=>'Doocyada la xulay lagama reebi doono dhammaan hagaajinta.','Tuning CSS Settings'=>'Hagaajinta Dejinta CSS','Listed CSS files or inline CSS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Faylasha CSS ee la qoray ama koodka CSS ee inline-ka ah lama yarayn doono mana la isku dari doono.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings'=>'Liiska horay loo sii qeexay ayaa sidoo kale lagu dari doonaa goobaha kore','Listed CSS files will be excluded from UCSS and saved to inline.'=>'Faylasha CSS ee la liiska soosaaray waa laga reebi doonaa UCSS waxaana lagu keydin doonaa inline.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in UCSS.'=>'Qor xuliyeyaasha CSS ee qaab-dhismeedkooda ay tahay in mar walba lagu daro UCSS.','Learn more'=>'Wax badan baro','Wildcard %s supported.'=>'Wildcard %s waa la taageeray.','The selector must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Soogaruhuhu waa inay ka jirtaa CSS-ka. Fasallada waalidka ee ku jira HTML-ka ma shaqeyn doonaan.','Listed URI will not generate UCSS.'=>'URI-ga la taxay ma dhalin doono UCSS.','Use %1$s to generate one single UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s while other page types still per URL.'=>'Adeegso %1$s si aad u abuurto hal UCSS oo loogu talagalay bogagga nooca boggoodu yahay %2$s halka noocyada kale ee bogaggu ay weli ku saleysan yihiin URL kasta.','Use %1$s to bypass UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s.'=>'Adeegso %1$s si aad uga gudubto UCSS bogagga ay nooca boggoodu yahay %2$s.','List post types where each item of that type should have its own CCSS generated.'=>'Liiska noocyada qoraallada halkaas oo shay kasta oo ka mid ah noocaas ah uu yeelanayo CCSS-kiisa oo la soo saaray.','For example, if every Page on the site has different formatting, enter %s in the box. Separate critical CSS files will be stored for every Page on the site.'=>'Tusaale ahaan, haddii Bog kasta oo ku yaalla bogga uu leeyahay qaabayn duwan, geli %s sanduuqa. Faylal gaar ah oo CSS ah oo muhiim ah ayaa loo kaydin doonaa Bog kasta oo ku yaalla bogga.','Separate critical CSS files will be generated for paths containing these strings.'=>'Faylal gaar ah oo ah CSS muhiim ah ayaa loo abuuri doonaa waddooyinka ka kooban xargahan.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in CCSS.'=>'Qor xuliyeyaasha CSS ee ay tahay in qaabkooda mar walba lagu daro CCSS.','Selectors must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Xuliyayaashu waa inay ka dhex jiraan CSS-ka. Fasallada waalidka ee ku jira HTML-ka ma shaqeyn doonaan.','Specify critical CSS rules for above-the-fold content when enabling %s.'=>'Caydi xeerarka CSS ee muhiimka ah ee ku jira nuxurka kore markaad awood-siinayso %s.','When you use Lazy Load, it will delay the loading of all images on a page.'=>'Markasta oo aad isticmaasho Lazy Load, waxay dib u dhigi doontaa raridda dhammaan sawirrada ku jira bogga.','The Viewport Images service detects which images appear above the fold, and excludes them from lazy load.'=>'Adeegga Viewport Images wuxuu ogaadaa sawirrada ka muuqda halka sare ee bogga, wuxuuna ka reebaa culayska caajiska ah.','This enables the page\'s initial screenful of imagery to be fully displayed without delay.'=>'Tani waxay sahlaysaa in shaashadda koowaad ee sawirrada bogga ay si buuxda u soo baxdo iyada oo aan dib loo dhigin.','Enable Viewport Images auto generation cron.'=>'Kici cron-ka si otomaatig ah loogu abuuro sawirada Viewport-ka.','Standard Presets'=>'Heerarka Horey loo sii qeexay','Import / Export'=>'Soo dejinta / Soo dhoofinta','Zinn® Cache Engine Configuration Presets'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Habaynta Horay-loo-sii-ideeyay','Essentials'=>'Waxyaabaha Muhiimka ah','Default Cache'=>'Kaydka Caadiga ah','Higher TTL'=>'TTL Sare','This no-risk preset is appropriate for all websites. Good for new users, simple websites, or cache-oriented development.'=>'Dejintaan aan khatarta lahayn waxay ku habboon tahay dhammaan mareegaha. Waxay u fiican tahay isticmaaleyaasha cusub, mareegaha fudud, ama horumarinta kayd-u-jeedka leh.','Basic'=>'Aasaasi','Everything in Essentials, Plus'=>'Wax kasta oo ku jira Essentials, iyo wax dheeraad ah','Mobile Cache'=>'Kaydka Mobilka','This low-risk preset introduces basic optimizations for speed and user experience. Appropriate for enthusiastic beginners.'=>'Qaabkan khatartiisu hooseyso wuxuu soo bandhigayaa hagaajin aasaasi ah oo loogu talagalay xawaaraha iyo khibradda isticmaalaha. Ku habboon bilowadayaasha xamaasadda leh.','Includes optimizations known to improve site score in page speed measurement tools. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Waxaa ku jira hagaajinno la og yahay inay kor u qaadaan dhibcaha mareegaha ee qalabka lagu cabbiro xawaaraha bogagga. Qaarkood waxay u baahan yihiin adeeg soo saarid online ah, kaas oo aan ku jirin qalabkan, kuwaasina wax saameyn ah ma leh.','Advanced (Recommended)'=>'Horumarsan (Lagu talinayo)','Everything in Basic, Plus'=>'Wax kasta oo ku jira Basic, Plus','Guest Mode and Guest Optimization'=>'Qaabka Martida iyo Hagaajinta Martida','CSS, JS and HTML Minification'=>'So gaabinta CSS, JS iyo HTML','JS Defer for both external and inline JS'=>'JS Defer labada JS ee dibadda ah iyo kuwa gudaha ah labadaba','DNS Prefetch for static files'=>'DNS Prefetch ee faylasha taagan','Remove Query Strings from Static Files'=>'Ka saar Xargaha Su\'aasha Faylasha Taagan','This preset is good for most websites, and is unlikely to cause conflicts. Any CSS or JS conflicts may be resolved with Page Optimization > Tuning tools.'=>'Qaabkan hore waxa uu u fiican yahay mareegaha ugu badan, mana u badna in uu keeno is-khilaaf. Wixii khilaaf ah ee CSS ama JS ah waxaa lagu xallin karaa qalabka Optimaylashanka Bogga > Hagaajinta.','Includes many optimizations known to improve page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Waxaa ku jira habeynno badan oo la og yahay inay wanaajiyaan dhibcaha xawaaraha bogga. Qaar kamid ah waxay u baahan yihiin adeeg jiilka internetka ah, kaas oo aan ku jirin qalabkan furan, kuwaasina wax saameyn ah ma leh.','Aggressive'=>'Adag','Everything in Advanced, Plus'=>'Wax kasta oo ku jira Advanced, Plus','CSS & JS Combine'=>'Isku-darka CSS & JS','Asynchronous CSS Loading with Critical CSS'=>'Soodajinta Asynchronous CSS ee leh Critical CSS','Removed Unused CSS for Users'=>'CSS-ka aan la isticmaalin waa laga saaray isticmaaleyaasha','Lazy Load for Iframes'=>'Dajinta Caajiska ah ee I-frames-ka','This preset might work out of the box for some websites, but be sure to test! Some CSS or JS exclusions may be necessary in Page Optimization > Tuning.'=>'Habkani waxa laga yaabaa inuu si toos ah u shaqeeyo balse xaqiiji adigoo tijaabinaya! Qaar ka mid ah ka reebista CSS ama JS ayaa laga yaabaa inay lagama maarmaan noqdaan qaybta Bogga Habaynta > Hagaajinta (Page Optimization > Tuning).','Extreme'=>'Xad dhaaf ah','Everything in Aggressive, Plus'=>'Wax kasta oo ku jira Aggressive, Plus','Lazy Load for Images'=>'Soojarid Caajis ah oo loogu talogalay Sawirada','Viewport Image Generation'=>'Abuurista Sawirka Viewport','JS Delayed'=>'JavaScript Dib u dhacay','Inline JS added to Combine'=>'JavaScript-ka gudaha ah ee lagu daray Combine','Inline CSS added to Combine'=>'CSS-ka gudaha ah ee lagu daray Combine','This preset almost certainly will require testing and exclusions for some CSS, JS and Lazy Loaded images. Pay special attention to logos, or HTML-based slider images.'=>'Horayntu tani waxay ku dhowdahay inaanay suurtagal ahayn in aanay u baahnayn tijaabin iyo ka reebitaan CSS, JS iyo sawirrada Lazy Loaded qaarkood. Si gaar ah ugu fiirso astaamaha, ama sawirrada slider-ka ee ku saleysan HTML.','Enables the maximum level of optimizations for improved page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Wuxuu suurtagelinayaa heerka ugu sarreeya ee hagaajinta si loo wanaajiyo dhibcaha xawaaraha bogga. Qaar kamid ah ayaa u baahan adeeg jiilka khadka tooska ah, oo aan ku jirin qalabkan, kuwaasina wax saameyn ah ma leh.','Zinn® Cache Engine Standard Presets'=>'Heerarka Heerka ee Zinn® Cache Engine','Use an official LiteSpeed-designed Preset to configure your site in one click. Try no-risk caching essentials, extreme optimization, or something in between.'=>'Isticmaal Hordhac rasmi ah oo ay naqshadaysay LiteSpeed si aad bartaada ugu qaabeyso hal guji. Tijaabi muhiimadaha kaydinta ee aan halista lahayn, wanaajinta xad-dhaafka ah, ama wax u dhexeeya.','Who should use this preset?'=>'Yaa ay tahay inuu isticmaalo qaabkan hore loo sii qeexay?','This will back up your current settings and replace them with the %1$s preset settings. Do you want to continue?'=>'Tani waxay keydin doontaa dejintaada hadda waxayna ku beddeli doontaa dejinta horay loo sii dejiyay ee %1$s. Ma rabtaa inaad sii waddo?','Apply Preset'=>'Codso Horey loo sii qorsheeyay','unknown'=>'aan la aqoon','History'=>'Taariikhda','Error: Failed to apply the settings %1$s'=>'Khalad: Ku guuldarraystay in la dabaqdo dejinta %1$s','Restored backup settings %1$s'=>'Dejinta kaydinta ee dib loo soo celiyay %1$s','Applied the %1$s preset %2$s'=>'La adeegsaday %1$s qaabka hore loo sii dejiyay %2$s','Backup created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset'=>'Keydka ayaa la abuuray %1$s ka hor inta aan la adeegsan qaabka hore ee %2$s','This will restore the backup settings created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset. Any changes made since then will be lost. Do you want to continue?'=>'Tani waxay soo celinaysaa dejinta kaydka ah ee la sameeyay %1$s ka hor inta aan la dabaqin %2$s hordhaca ah. Wixii isbeddel ah ee la sameeyay wixii markaas ka dambeeyay waa la waayayaa. Ma rabtaa inaad sii waddo?','Restore Settings'=>'Soo celinta Dejinta','Zinn® Cache Engine View .htaccess'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine View .htaccess','.htaccess Path'=>'Jidka .htaccess','Frontend .htaccess Path'=>'Jidka Frontend .htaccess','Default path is'=>'Waddada caadiga ah waa','PHP Constant %s is supported.'=>'Joogtada PHP ee %s waa la taageeray.','You can use this code %1$s in %2$s to specify the htaccess file path.'=>'Waxaad isticmaali kartaa koodkan %1$s gudaha %2$s si aad u cayinto waddada faylka htaccess.','Backend .htaccess Path'=>'Jidka .htaccess ee Backend-ka','Current %s Contents'=>'Waxyaabaha ku jira %s ee hadda','View .htaccess'=>'Fiiri .htaccess','Heartbeat'=>'Wadnaha garaaca','Debug Settings'=>'Dejinta Cilad-bixinta','Log View'=>'Muuqaalka Diiwaanka','Zinn® Cache Engine Toolbox'=>'Sanduuqa Qalabka Matoorka Kaydka Ku-meel-gaarka ah ee Zinn®','Heartbeat Control'=>'Xakamaynta Wadnahyaalka','Disable WordPress interval heartbeat to reduce server load.'=>'Dami interval heartbeat-ka WordPress si loo yareeyo culayska adeegaha.','Disabling this may cause WordPress tasks triggered by AJAX to stop working.'=>'Joojintani waxay keeni kartaa in hawlaha WordPress ee ay kiciyaan AJAX ay joojiyaan shaqada.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on frontend.'=>'Shid si aad u xakameyso garaaca wadnaha ee frontend-ka.','Specify the %s heartbeat interval in seconds.'=>'Cabbirka garaaca wadnaha ee %s ku cayimi ilbiriqsiyo.','WordPress valid interval is %s seconds.'=>'Muddada ansaxda ah ee WordPress waa %s ilbidhiqsi.','Set to %1$s to forbid heartbeat on %2$s.'=>'U dhig %1$s si aad u diiddo garaaca wadnaha ee %2$s.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on backend.'=>'Shid si aad u xakameyso wadnaha garaaca ee backend-ka.','Turn ON to control heartbeat in backend editor.'=>'Daar si aad u xakameyso wadnaha garaaca ee tifaftiraha dambe.','Export Settings'=>'Dejinta Dhoofinta','Export'=>'Dhoofin','Last exported'=>'Key dhoofiskii ugu dambeeyay','This will export all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings and save them as a file.'=>'Tani waxay dhoofin doontaa dhammaan dejinnada Zinn® Cache Engine ee hadda waxayna u kaydin doontaa sidii fayl.','Import Settings'=>'Dejinta Soo dejinta','Import'=>'Keenso','Last imported'=>'U dambeeyay ee la soo dejiyay','This will import settings from a file and override all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings.'=>'Tani waxay ka soo dejin doontaa dejinta fayl waxayna burin doontaa dhammaan dejinta hadda ee Zinn® Cache Engine.','Reset All Settings'=>'Dib u deji dhammaan dejinta','This will reset all settings to default settings.'=>'Tani waxay dib u dejineysaa dhammaan habeynta sidii asalka aheyd.','Are you sure you want to reset all settings back to the default settings?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad dib ugu celiso dhammaan habaynta sidii ay asal ahaan ahayd?','Reset Settings'=>'Dib u deji Dejinta','Purge Log'=>'Tirtir Log-ka','Crawler Log'=>'Diiwaanka Cilmibaaraha','LiteSpeed Logs'=>'LiteSpeed Diiwaannada','Clear Logs'=>'Nadiifi Diiwaannada','Click to copy'=>'Guji si aad u guuriso','Copy Log'=>'Nuqul Ka Diiwaanka','Click to download'=>'Guji si aad u soo dejiso','Download'=>'Soo dejiso','Purge Front Page'=>'Nadiifi Bogga Hore','This will Purge Front Page only'=>'Tani waxay nadiifin doontaa Bogga Hore oo keliya','Purge Pages'=>'Nadiifi Bogagga','This will Purge Pages only'=>'Tani waxay nadiifin doontaa Bogagga oo keliya','Purge %s Error'=>'Nadiifi Ciladaha %s','Purge %s error pages'=>'Nadiifi bogagga khaladaadka ee %s','Purge the LiteSpeed cache entries created by this plugin'=>'Tirtir galitaanka kaydka LiteSpeed ee uu abuuray qalabkan','This will purge all minified/combined CSS/JS entries only'=>'Tani waxay tirtiri doontaa dhammaan diiwaannada CSS/JS ee la habeeyey/la mideeyey oo keliya','Purge all the object caches'=>'Nadiifi dhammaan keydinta walxaha','Reset the entire opcode cache'=>'Dib u deji dhammaan kaydka opcode','Critical CSS'=>'CSS-ka Halbowlaha ah','This will delete all generated critical CSS files'=>'Tani waxa ay tirtiri doontaa dhammaan faylasha CSS-ka muhiimka ah ee la soo saaray','Unique CSS'=>'CSS-ga Gaarka ah','This will delete all generated unique CSS files'=>'Tani waxay tirtiri doontaa dhammaan faylasha CSS ee gaarka ah ee la abuuray','This will delete all localized resources'=>'Tani waxay tirtiri doontaa dhammaan agabka la sooceyay','This will delete all generated image LQIP placeholder files'=>'Tani waxay tirtiri doontaa dhammaan faylasha meel-qabashada ee LQIP ee sawirka la sameeyay','This will delete all generated Viewport Images'=>'Tani waxay tirtiri doontaa dhammaan Sawirrada Viewport ee la abuuray','This will delete all cached Gravatar files'=>'Tani waxay tirtiri doontaa dhammaan faylasha Gravatar ee kaydsan','Purge the cache entries created by this plugin except for Critical CSS & Unique CSS & LQIP caches'=>'Tirtir diiwaannada kaydka ee uu abuuray lacag-gelintani marka laga reebo kaydka Critical CSS & Unique CSS & LQIP','Empty Entire Cache'=>'Masax Kaydka oo dhan','Clears all cache entries related to this site, including other web applications.'=>'Waxay nadiifisaa dhammaan galitaannada kaydinta ee la xiriira boggan, oo ay ku jiraan codsiyada kale ee mareegaha.','This action should only be used if things are cached incorrectly.'=>'Tallaabadan waa in la isticmaalo oo keliya haddii waxyaabaha si khaldan loo kaydiyey.','This will clear EVERYTHING inside the cache.'=>'Tani waxay tirtiri doontaa wax kasta oo ku jira kaydka (cache).','This may cause heavy load on the server.'=>'Tani waxay sababi kartaa culeys culus oo ku yimaada adeega (server-ka).','If only the WordPress site should be purged, use Purge All.'=>'Haddii goobta WordPress kaliya la nadiifinayo, isticmaal Purge All.','Purge By...'=>'Nadiifi Iyadoo La Adeegsanayo...','Select below for "Purge by" options.'=>'Xulo hoose si aad u hesho fursadaha "Nadiifi iyadoo loo eegayo".','Category'=>'Qeybta','Post ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Qoraalka','Tag'=>'Calaamadii','Purge pages by category name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Bogagga tirtir magaca qaybta - tusaale ahaan %2$s waa in loo isticmaalo URL-ka %1$s.','Purge pages by post ID.'=>'Ka tirtir bogocyada ID-ga qoraalka.','Purge pages by tag name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Ka tirtir bogagga magaca sumadda - tusaale ahaan %2$s waa in loo isticmaalo URL-ka %1$s.','Purge pages by relative or full URL.'=>'Ka nadiifi boggaga URL-ka qaraabada ama buuxa.','e.g. Use %1$s or %2$s.'=>'t.a. Isticmaal %1$s ama %2$s.','Purge List'=>'Liiska Nadiifinta','Debug Helpers'=>'Caawiye-yaasha Cilmi-bixinta','View Site Before Optimization'=>'Eeg Bogga Intaan la Hagaajin','View Site Before Cache'=>'Ka Eeg Goobta Ka Hor Inta Aanu Kaydku Dhicin','Disable All Features for 24 Hours'=>'Dami Dhammaan Tilmaamaha 24 Saacadood','Remove `Disable All Feature` Flag Now'=>'Hadda Ka Saar Calanka `Disable All Feature`','Zinn® Cache Engine is temporarily disabled until: %s.'=>'Mashiinka Kaydinta ee Zinn® waxaa loo joojiyay si KMG ah ilaa iyo: %s.','This will disable LSCache and all optimization features for debug purpose.'=>'Tani waxay u joojin doontaa LSCache iyo dhammaan sifooyinka wanaajinta ujeeddooyinka cillad-baxa.','Admin IP Only'=>'IP-ga Maamulaha Kaliya','Outputs to a series of files in the %s directory.'=>'Waxay ku soo saaraysaa taxane faylal ah galka %s.','To prevent filling up the disk, this setting should be OFF when everything is working.'=>'Si looga hortago in saxanku buuxsamo, dejintani waa inay damin tahay marka wax walba ay si sax ah u shaqaynayaan.','The Admin IP option will only output log messages on requests from admin IPs listed below.'=>'Ikhtiyaarka Admin IP wuxuu soo saari doonaa oo qura fariimaha diiwaanka ee codsiyada ka yimid IP-yada maamulaha ee hoos ku qoran.','Allows listed IPs (one per line) to perform certain actions from their browsers.'=>'Waxay u oggolaanaysaa IP-yada ku qoran (midkiiba hal sadar) inay ka qabtaan hawlo gaar ah daalacashadooda.','Your IP'=>'IP-gaaga','More information about the available commands can be found here.'=>'Macluumaad dheeraad ah oo ku saabsan amarada la heli karo waxaa laga heli karaa halkan.','MB'=>'MB','Specify the maximum size of the log file.'=>'Cadde cabirka ugu badan ee diiwaanka.','Shorten query strings in the debug log to improve readability.'=>'Gabajirida xogta su\'aasha ee diiwaanka cillad-saarka si loo hagaajiyo akhriska.','Only log listed pages.'=>'Kaliya gal bogoggada ku qoran liiska.','Prevent any debug log of listed pages.'=>'Ka hortag dukumientiga dhibaato-raadinta (debug log) ee bogagga ku qoran.','Prevent writing log entries that include listed strings.'=>'Ka hortag qorista gelitaanka diiwaanka ee ay ku jiraan xarfo taxan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Eeg qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey ayaa ku guuldareysatay hubinta daacadnimadeeda mana la rakibin.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri %s hagaha isticmaalaha','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed,madax-bixinnada maalinlaha ah, haajiradda lacag la\'aanta ah iyo guddiga maamulka ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal degel.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibsoo oo iibi bogag la dhisay, agabyada internetka iyo meelaha lagu xidho xiriiriyeyaasha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo haynayo ilaa labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan shaqadan u leh noloshooda','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa kala iibsiga ee madaxa-bannaan ee caalamiga ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyeyaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u ogolow inay ku tartamaan.']];